// ==============================================================================
// பாடம் 1: திராவிட மொழிக் குடும்பம் (உரைநடை உலகம்) [Q001 - Q028]
// திராவிட மொழிகள், தென்/நடு/வட திராவிட மொழிகள், பிரான்சிஸ் எல்லிஸ், ராபர்ட் கால்டுவெல் (1856 ஒப்பிலக்கணம்), எண்ணுப்பெயர்கள், அடிச்சொற்கள், பால்பாகுபாடு
// ==============================================================================
{"id": "9th-u1-q001", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-dravida-mozhi-kudumbam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-mozhi-thotram-kudumbangal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "மொழியின் தோற்றம் மற்றும் இந்திய மொழிக் குடும்பங்கள் குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. மனிதன் தன் எண்ணங்களை மெய்ப்பாடுகள், சைகைகள், ஒலிகள், ஓவியங்கள் முதலியவற்றின் வழியாகப் பிறருக்குத் தெரிவித்தனர்.\n2. இந்தியாவில் 1300-க்கும் மேற்பட்ட மொழிகளும் நான்கு மொழிக் குடும்பங்களும் உள்ளன.\n3. 'திராவிடம்' என்னும் சொல்லை முதலில் குறிப்பிட்டவர் கால்டுவெல் ஆவார்.\nமேற்கண்ட கூற்றுகளுள் சரியானவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1, 2 மட்டும் சரி", "B": "2, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "C": "1, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "D": "அனைத்தும் சரி"}, "explanation": "'திராவிடம்' என்னும் சொல்லை முதன்முதலில் குறிப்பிட்டவர் குமரிலபட்டர் ஆவார் (கால்டுவெல் அல்ல). எனவே கூற்று 3 தவறு; கூற்றுகள் 1 மற்றும் 2 சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Analyze the following statements regarding the origin of language and Indian language families:\n1. Early humans conveyed their thoughts through emotions, gestures, sounds, and paintings.\n2. India has more than 1300 languages classified under four major language families.\n3. The term 'Dravida' was first mentioned by Robert Caldwell.\nWhich of the above statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 and 2 only are correct", "B": "2 and 3 only are correct", "C": "1 and 3 only are correct", "D": "All are correct"}, "explanation": "The term 'Dravida' was first mentioned by Kumarilabhatta (not Caldwell). Hence statement 3 is incorrect; 1 and 2 are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 4, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 4", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["dravidian_family", "origin_of_language", "statement_analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q002", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-dravida-mozhi-kudumbam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-indhiya-mozhi-kudumbangal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இந்தியாவில் பேசப்படும் மொழிக் குடும்பங்களையும் அவற்றின் கூறுகளையும் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I:\na) இந்தோ-ஆசியன்\nb) திராவிடம்\nc) ஆஸ்ட்ரோ-ஆசியாடிக்\nd) சீன-திபெத்தியன்\n\nபட்டியல் II:\n1. சந்தாலி, முண்டா உள்ளிட்ட பழங்குடி மொழிகள்\n2. சமஸ்கிருதம், இந்தி முதலான வடமொழிகள்\n3. போடோ, மணிப்பூரி உள்ளிட்ட வடகிழக்கு மொழிகள்\n4. தமிழ், மலையாளம் உள்ளிட்ட தென்மொழிகள்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-4, c-2, d-3", "B": "a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3", "C": "a-4, b-2, c-3, d-1", "D": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3"}, "explanation": "இந்திய மொழிக் குடும்பங்கள்: இந்தோ-ஆசியன் (வடமொழிகள்: சமஸ்கிருதம்/இந்தி); திராவிடம் (தமிழ்/தென்மொழிகள்); ஆஸ்ட்ரோ-ஆசியாடிக் (சந்தாலி/முண்டா); சீன-திபெத்தியன் (வடகிழக்கு மொழிகள்). சரியான பொருத்தம்: 2, 4, 1, 3."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the Indian language families with their representative groups:\nList I: a) Indo-Asian, b) Dravidian, c) Austro-Asiatic, d) Sino-Tibetan\nList II: 1. Santhali & Munda tribal tongues, 2. Sanskrit & Hindi Northern tongues, 3. Bodo & Manipuri North-Eastern tongues, 4. Tamil & Malayalam Southern tongues", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-4, c-2, d-3", "B": "a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3", "C": "a-4, b-2, c-3, d-1", "D": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3"}, "explanation": "Indo-Asian = Sanskrit/Hindi (2); Dravidian = Tamil/Malayalam (4); Austro-Asiatic = Santhali/Munda (1); Sino-Tibetan = Bodo/Manipuri (3). Order: 2, 4, 1, 3."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 4, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 4", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["language_families", "matching", "india_languages"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q003", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-dravida-mozhi-kudumbam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-mozhi-katchisalai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'இந்தியா பல மொழிகளின் காட்சிகூடமாகத் திகழ்கிறது' என்று குறிப்பிட்ட மொழியியல் அறிஞர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "டாக்டர் ராபர்ட் கால்டுவெல்", "B": "வில்லியம் ஜோன்ஸ்", "C": "முனைவர் ச. அகத்தியலிங்கம்", "D": "ஹீராஸ் பாதிரியார்"}, "explanation": "இந்தியாவில் 1300-க்கும் மேற்பட்ட மொழிகள் பேசப்படுவதால் 'இந்தியா பல மொழிகளின் காட்சிகூடமாகத் திகழ்கிறது' எனக் கூறியவர் பேராசிரியர் ச. அகத்தியலிங்கம் ஆவார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which linguistic scholar stated that 'India appears as a museum of languages'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Dr. Robert Caldwell", "B": "Sir William Jones", "C": "Prof. S. Agasthialingam", "D": "Rev. Fr. Heras"}, "explanation": "Linguist Prof. S. Agasthialingam noted that India serves as a 'museum of languages' due to over 1,300 languages spoken across the subcontinent."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 4, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 4", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["dravidian_family", "scholars", "direct_mcq"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q004", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-dravida-mozhi-kudumbam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-heras-etymology", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஹீராஸ் பாதிரியார் 'திராவிடம்' என்ற சொல்லின் தோற்றம் குறித்துக் கூறிய மாற்ற வரிசையில் சரியான வரிசை எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "திராவிடம் → த்ரமிட → த்ரமிள → திரமிள → தமிழ்", "B": "தமிழ் → திரமிள → த்ராவிட → த்ரமிட → திராவிடம்", "C": "திரமிள → த்ரமிட → தமிழ் → த்ராவிட → திராவிடம்", "D": "தமிழ் → தமழா → த்ரமில → த்ரமிட → த்ராவிட → திராவிடம்"}, "explanation": "ஹீராஸ் பாதிரியார்: தமிழ் → தமழா → த்ரமில → த்ரமிட → த்ராவிட → திராவிடம் என்ற மாற்ற வரிசையைக் குறிப்பிட்டார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the correct sequential phonetic evolution of the word 'Dravida' from 'Tamil' as proposed by Father Heras?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Dravidam → Dramida → Dramila → Tiramila → Tamil", "B": "Tamil → Tiramila → Dravida → Dramida → Dravidam", "C": "Tiramila → Dramida → Tamil → Dravida → Dravidam", "D": "Tamil → Tamazha → Tramila → Dramida → Dravida → Dravidam"}, "explanation": "Rev. Fr. Heras demonstrated the derivation order: Tamil → Tamazha → Tramila → Dramida → Dravida → Dravidam."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 5, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 5", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["dravidian_family", "word_etymology", "heras"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q005", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "assertion_reason", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-dravida-mozhi-kudumbam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-francis-ellis", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): பிரான்சிஸ் எல்லிஸ் தமிழ், தெலுங்கு, கன்னடம், மலையாளம் போன்ற மொழிகளை ஒப்புநோக்கி, இவை தனி ஒரு மொழிக் குடும்பத்தைச் சேர்ந்தவை என்றார்.\nகாரணம் (R): இம்மொழிகள் வடமொழியிலிருந்து உருவானவை அல்ல என்றும், இவற்றிற்குத் 'தமிழிக்' என்றும் பெயரிட்டார்.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் சரி; காரணம் கூற்றை விளக்குகிறது", "B": "கூற்று (A) சரி, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) தவறு", "C": "கூற்று (A) தவறு, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) சரி", "D": "கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் தவறு"}, "explanation": "1816-இல் பிரான்சிஸ் எல்லிஸ் தென்னிந்திய மொழிகளை வடமொழியோடு தொடர்பற்ற தனிக்குடும்பம் என நிறுவி 'தமிழிக்' எனப் பெயரிட்டார். கூற்று மற்றும் காரணம் இரண்டும் முற்றிலும் சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): Francis Whyte Ellis compared Tamil, Telugu, Kannada, and Malayalam and concluded that they belong to a distinct language family.\nReason (R): He established that these languages were not derived from Sanskrit and designated them collectively as 'South Indian / Tamulic'.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are correct, and (R) correctly explains (A)", "B": "(A) is correct, but (R) is false", "C": "(A) is false, but (R) is true", "D": "Both (A) and (R) are false"}, "explanation": "In 1816, F.W. Ellis recognized these southern tongues as an independent family unrelated to Sanskrit and coined the collective name 'Tamulic'. Both (A) and (R) are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 5, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 5", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["dravidian_family", "assertion_reason", "francis_ellis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q006", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-dravida-mozhi-kudumbam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-caldwell-comparative-grammar", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ராபர்ட் கால்டுவெல் மற்றும் அவரது ஒப்பிலக்கண நூல் குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. கால்டுவெல் 1856-ஆம் ஆண்டு 'திராவிட மொழிகளின் ஒப்பிலக்கணம்' என்னும் நூலை வெளியிட்டார்.\n2. திராவிட மொழிகள் ஆரிய மொழிக் குடும்பத்தோடு மிக நெருங்கிய தொடர்புடையவை என்று அவர் நிறுவினார்.\n3. திராவிட மொழிகள் சமஸ்கிருதத்திற்கு உட்படாமல் தனித்தியங்கும் ஆற்றல் பெற்றவை என்பதைச் சான்றுகளுடன் மெய்ப்பித்தார்.\nமேற்கண்டவற்றுள் சரியான கூற்றுகள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1, 2 மட்டும்", "B": "1, 3 மட்டும்", "C": "2, 3 மட்டும்", "D": "அனைத்தும்"}, "explanation": "கால்டுவெல் திராவிட மொழிகள் ஆரிய மொழிக் குடும்பத்தோடு தொடர்பற்றவை, சமஸ்கிருதத் தாக்கமின்றி தனித்தியங்கும் பேராற்றல் கொண்டவை என்று நிறுவினார். கூற்று 2 தவறு; 1 மற்றும் 3 சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Examine the statements regarding Robert Caldwell and his work 'A Comparative Grammar of the Dravidian Languages':\n1. Caldwell published his seminal work 'A Comparative Grammar of the Dravidian Languages' in 1856.\n2. He asserted that Dravidian languages are intimately related to the Indo-Aryan language family.\n3. He proved with evidence that Dravidian languages possess independent vitality without depending on Sanskrit.\nWhich of the statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 and 2 only", "B": "1 and 3 only", "C": "2 and 3 only", "D": "All 1, 2, and 3"}, "explanation": "Caldwell proved Dravidian languages are distinct from Indo-Aryan tongues and flourish independently of Sanskrit. Statement 2 is incorrect; 1 and 3 are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 5, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 5", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["caldwell", "comparative_grammar", "statement_analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q007", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-dravida-mozhi-kudumbam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-then-dravida-mozhi", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தென் திராவிட மொழிகள் தொகுப்பில் பொருந்தாத ஒன்றைக் கண்டறிக:", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "குடகு (கொடகு)", "B": "தோடா, கோத்தா", "C": "தெலுங்கு", "D": "இருளா, கொரகா"}, "explanation": "தெலுங்கு நடு திராவிட மொழி ஆகும் (தென் திராவிட மொழி அல்ல). தமிழ், மலையாளம், கன்னடம், குடகு, துளு, தோடா, கோத்தா, கொரகா, இருளா ஆகியவை தென் திராவிட மொழிகள்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Identify the language that does NOT belong to the South Dravidian language group:", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kodagu (Coorg)", "B": "Toda, Kota", "C": "Telugu", "D": "Irula, Koraga"}, "explanation": "Telugu belongs to the Central Dravidian group. South Dravidian includes Tamil, Malayalam, Kannada, Kodagu, Tulu, Toda, Kota, Koraga, and Irula."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 6, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 6", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["dravidian_classification", "south_dravidian", "odd_one_out"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q008", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-dravida-mozhi-kudumbam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-moththa-dravida-mozhi", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "அண்மையில் கண்டறியப்பட்ட எருகலா, தங்கா, குறும்பா, சோளிகா ஆகிய 4 மொழிகளையும் சேர்த்துத் திராவிட மொழிகள் மொத்தம் எத்தனை எனக் குறிக்கப்படுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "24", "B": "26", "C": "27", "D": "28"}, "explanation": "ஏற்கெனவே வகைப்படுத்தப்பட்ட 24 மொழிகளுடன் அண்மையில் ஆய்வு செய்யப்பட்ட எருகலா, தங்கா, குறும்பா, சோளிகா ஆகிய 4 மொழிகள் சேர்ந்து மொத்தம் 28 திராவிட மொழிகள் எனப் பட்டியலிடப்பட்டுள்ளன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Including the recently identified tongues Erukala, Thanga, Kurumba, and Soliga, how many total languages are recognized under the Dravidian family?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "24 languages", "B": "26 languages", "C": "27 languages", "D": "28 languages"}, "explanation": "Along with the initial 24 languages, the 4 additions (Erukala, Thanga, Kurumba, Soliga) make a total of 28 Dravidian languages."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 6, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 6", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["dravidian_family", "language_count", "direct_mcq"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q009", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-dravida-mozhi-kudumbam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-dravida-vagaipadu-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "திராவிட மொழிக் குடும்பங்களின் பிரிவுகளையும் அவற்றில் அடங்கியுள்ள மொழிகளையும் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I:\na) தென் திராவிடம்\nb) நடு திராவிடம்\nc) வட திராவிடம்\nd) அண்மைக் கண்டுபிடிப்பு\n\nபட்டியல் II:\n1. குரூக், மால்தோ, பிராகுய்\n2. எருகலா, தங்கா, குறும்பா\n3. கோண்டா, கோலாமி, கூயி, பெங்கோ\n4. துளு, தோடா, கொரகா, இருளா", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-4, b-3, c-1, d-2", "B": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "C": "a-4, b-1, c-3, d-2", "D": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4"}, "explanation": "தென் திராவிடம்: துளு, தோடா, கொரகா, இருளா (4); நடு திராவிடம்: கோண்டா, கோலாமி, கூயி, பெங்கோ (3); வட திராவிடம்: குரூக், மால்தோ, பிராகுய் (1); அண்மை மொழிகள்: எருகலா, தங்கா, குறும்பா (2). வரிசை: 4, 3, 1, 2."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the Dravidian sub-families with their member languages:\nList I: a) South Dravidian, b) Central Dravidian, c) North Dravidian, d) Recent discoveries\nList II: 1. Kurukh, Malto, Brahui; 2. Erukala, Thanga, Kurumba; 3. Konda, Kolami, Kui, Pengo; 4. Tulu, Toda, Koraga, Irula", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-4, b-3, c-1, d-2", "B": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "C": "a-4, b-1, c-3, d-2", "D": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4"}, "explanation": "South Dravidian: Tulu/Toda (4); Central: Konda/Kolami (3); North: Kurukh/Malto/Brahui (1); Recent: Erukala/Thanga (2). Order: 4, 3, 1, 2."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 6, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 6", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["dravidian_classification", "matching", "tri_division"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q010", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-dravida-mozhi-kudumbam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-vada-dravida-brahui", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "வட திராவிட மொழிகள் மற்றும் பிராகுய் மொழி குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. வட திராவிட மொழிகள் குரூக், மால்தோ, பிராகுய் என மூன்றாகும்.\n2. பிராகுய் மொழி தற்காலப் பாகிஸ்தானின் பலுசிஸ்தான் பகுதியில் இன்றும் பேசப்பட்டு வருகிறது.\n3. மால்தோ மொழி தென்னிந்தியாவின் நீலகிரி மலைப்பகுதியில் பேசப்படும் மொழியாகும்.\nமேற்கண்டவற்றுள் சரியான கூற்றுகள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1, 3 மட்டும்", "B": "1, 2 மட்டும்", "C": "2, 3 மட்டும்", "D": "அனைத்தும்"}, "explanation": "மால்தோ என்பது மேற்கு வங்காளம் மற்றும் ஜார்க்கண்ட் எல்லையோர ராஜ்மகால் குன்றுகளில் பேசப்படும் வட திராவிட மொழி ஆகும் (நீலகிரி அல்ல). எனவே கூற்று 3 தவறு; 1 மற்றும் 2 சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Examine the statements regarding North Dravidian languages and Brahui:\n1. The three North Dravidian languages are Kurukh, Malto, and Brahui.\n2. Brahui is spoken in the Balochistan province of present-day Pakistan.\n3. Malto is a language spoken in the Nilgiri hills of South India.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 and 3 only", "B": "1 and 2 only", "C": "2 and 3 only", "D": "All are correct"}, "explanation": "Malto is spoken around the Rajmahal hills in eastern India (Jharkhand/Bengal), not the Nilgiris. Statements 1 and 2 are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 6, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 6", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["north_dravidian", "brahui", "statement_analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q011", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "assertion_reason", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-dravida-mozhi-kudumbam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-paal-kattum-vikuthi", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): திராவிட மொழிகளில் பெரும்பாலானவை வினைமுற்றுச் சொற்களில் திணை, பால், எண் ஆகியவற்றை உணர்த்தும் விகுதிகளைக் கொண்டுள்ளன.\nகாரணம் (R): மலையாள மொழியில் மட்டுமே திணை, பால் காட்டும் விகுதிகள் வினைகளில் இடம்பெறுவதில்லை; தனிச் சொற்களாலேயே பால் உணர்த்தப்படுகிறது.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கூற்று (A) சரி, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) தவறு", "B": "கூற்று (A) தவறு, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) சரி", "C": "கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் சரி; காரணம் கூற்றை விளக்குகிறது", "D": "கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் தவறு"}, "explanation": "திராவிட மொழிகளில் வினைகள் பால் காட்டும்; ஆனால் மலையாளத்தில் 'வந்தான்/வந்தாள்' எனப் பால் காட்டாது 'வந்நு' என்றே வரும். இவ்விரண்டு கூற்றுகளும் முற்றிலும் சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): Most Dravidian languages possess verb endings that clearly denote gender, number, and person.\nReason (R): Malayalam is an exception among Dravidian languages where verbs do not carry gender markers; gender is expressed through separate lexical words.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(A) is true, but (R) is false", "B": "(A) is false, but (R) is true", "C": "Both (A) and (R) are true, and (R) correctly explains (A)", "D": "Both (A) and (R) are false"}, "explanation": "Unlike Tamil, Malayalam verbs lack gender suffixes (e.g. 'vannu' instead of 'vandhaan/vandhaal'). Both (A) and (R) are factually correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 7, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 7", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["dravidian_grammar", "gender_markers", "assertion_reason"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q012", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-dravida-mozhi-kudumbam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-nadu-dravida-odd", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நடு திராவிட மொழிகள் பட்டியலில் சேராத ஒன்றைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்க:", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கூயி, கூவி", "B": "கோலாமி, நாய்க்கி", "C": "பர்ஜி, கதபா", "D": "குரூக்"}, "explanation": "குரூக் என்பது வட திராவிட மொழி (குரூக், மால்தோ, பிராகுய்). மற்ற அனைத்தும் நடு திராவிட மொழிகள் ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Pick the language that does NOT belong to the Central Dravidian group:", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kui, Kuvi", "B": "Kolami, Naiki", "C": "Parji, Gadaba", "D": "Kurukh"}, "explanation": "Kurukh belongs to the North Dravidian group. Kui, Kuvi, Kolami, Naiki, Parji, and Gadaba belong to Central Dravidian."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 6, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 6", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["central_dravidian", "odd_one_out", "classification"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q013", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-dravida-mozhi-kudumbam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-paal-pagupaadu-dravida-vs-indoaryan", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "வடமொழி மற்றும் திராவிட மொழிகளின் பால் பகுப்பு முறை குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. திராவிட மொழிகளில் பொருள்களின் தன்மையை ஒட்டி இயற்கையான முறையில் பால் பகுப்பு அமைந்துள்ளது.\n2. வடமொழியில் கைவிரல்கள் பெண்பால் என்றும், கால்விரல்கள் ஆண்பால் என்றும், வாய் ஆண்பால், மூக்கு பெண்பால், கண் பொதுப்பால் என்றும் பாகுபடுத்தப்படும் விசித்திர முறை உள்ளது.\n3. திராவிட மொழிகளில் கண்ணுக்குப் புலப்படாத நுண்பொருள்களும் பெண் பாலாகவே கொள்ளப்படும்.\nமேற்கண்டவற்றுள் சரியானவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1, 2 மட்டும் சரி", "B": "2, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "C": "1, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "D": "அனைத்தும் சரி"}, "explanation": "திராவிட மொழிகளில் உயர்திணை/அஃறிணை எனப் பொருள்களின் தன்மைக்கேற்ப பகுக்கப்படுகிறது. வடமொழியில் உறுப்புகளுக்கும் கற்பனைப் பால் பகுப்பு உள்ளது. கண்ணுக்குப் புலப்படாத பொருள்களை அஃறிணை ஒன்றன்பாலாகவே திராவிடம் கருதும் (கூற்று 3 தவறு). எனவே 1, 2 சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Analyze the following statements regarding the gender classification in Indo-Aryan vs Dravidian languages:\n1. Dravidian languages adopt a natural gender classification based on the inherent nature of objects (animate/inanimate).\n2. In Indo-Aryan languages, artificial gender is assigned to body parts (e.g., fingers as feminine, toes as masculine, mouth as masculine, nose as feminine, eyes as neuter).\n3. In Dravidian languages, abstract/invisible concepts are treated uniformly as feminine.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 and 2 only are correct", "B": "2 and 3 only are correct", "C": "1 and 3 only are correct", "D": "All are correct"}, "explanation": "In Dravidian tongues, abstract concepts are categorized under neuter (one/many), not feminine. Statements 1 and 2 are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 7, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 7", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["dravidian_grammar", "gender_comparison", "statement_analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q014", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-dravida-mozhi-kudumbam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-william-jones", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "18-ஆம் நூற்றாண்டின் இறுதியில் (1786-இல்) வடமொழியை ஆராய்ந்து, மற்ற ஐரோப்பிய மொழிகளோடு தொடர்புடையது என முதன்முதலில் குறிப்பிட்ட அறிஞர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மாக்ஸ் முல்லர்", "B": "சர் வில்லியம் ஜோன்ஸ்", "C": "ராபர்ட் கால்டுவெல்", "D": "பிரான்சிஸ் எல்லிஸ்"}, "explanation": "1786-இல் அறிஞர் சர் வில்லியம் ஜோன்ஸ் வடமொழியை ஆராய்ந்து, அது ஐரோப்பிய மொழிகளோடு நெருங்கிய தொடர்புடையது என்ற கருத்தை வெளியிட்டார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which scholar in 1786 first proposed that Sanskrit is historically related to classical European languages like Greek and Latin?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Max Müller", "B": "Sir William Jones", "C": "Dr. Robert Caldwell", "D": "Francis Whyte Ellis"}, "explanation": "Sir William Jones in 1786 demonstrated the linguistic affinities between Sanskrit, Greek, and Latin."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 5, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 5", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["scholars", "william_jones", "direct_mcq"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q015", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-dravida-mozhi-kudumbam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-dravida-aayvargal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "திராவிட மொழி ஆய்வாளர்களையும் அவர்களின் முக்கியப் பங்களிப்பையும் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I:\na) குமரிலபட்டர்\nb) பிரான்சிஸ் எல்லிஸ்\nc) ராபர்ட் கால்டுவெல்\nd) ஹீராஸ் பாதிரியார்\n\nபட்டியல் II:\n1. 'தமிழிக்' எனப் பெயரிட்டு தனிக்குடும்பம் என நிறுவியவர்\n2. தமிழ் → திராவிடம் சொல் மாற்றத்தை விளக்கியவர்\n3. 'திராவிடம்' என்ற சொல்லை முதன்முதலில் குறிப்பிட்டவர்\n4. திராவிட மொழிகளின் ஒப்பிலக்கணம் (1856) தந்தவர்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-3, c-4, d-2", "B": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "C": "a-3, b-1, c-4, d-2", "D": "a-4, b-1, c-2, d-3"}, "explanation": "குமரிலபட்டர் = 'திராவிடம்' சொல்லைக் குறிப்பிட்டவர் (3); எல்லிஸ் = 'தமிழிக்' (1); கால்டுவெல் = ஒப்பிலக்கணம் (4); ஹீராஸ் பாதிரியார் = தமிழ்→திராவிடம் ஒலிமாற்றம் (2). வரிசை: 3, 1, 4, 2."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the linguistic scholars with their notable contributions:\nList I: a) Kumarilabhatta, b) Francis Ellis, c) Robert Caldwell, d) Rev. Fr. Heras\nList II: 1. Coined 'Tamulic' and established Southern autonomy; 2. Traced Tamil → Dravida phonological shift; 3. First used the term 'Dravida'; 4. Authored 'Comparative Grammar' in 1856", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-3, c-4, d-2", "B": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "C": "a-3, b-1, c-4, d-2", "D": "a-4, b-1, c-2, d-3"}, "explanation": "Kumarilabhatta = 3; Francis Ellis = 1; Robert Caldwell = 4; Fr. Heras = 2. Sequence: 3, 1, 4, 2."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 5, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 5", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["scholars", "matching", "contributions"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q016", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-dravida-mozhi-kudumbam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-other-scholars", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கால்டுவெல்லிற்குப் பின்னர் திராவிட மொழிகள் குறித்து விரிவான ஆய்வுகளை மேற்கொண்ட அறிஞர்கள் பட்டியலில் இடம்பெறாதவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஸ்டென்கனோ, கே.வி. சுப்பையா", "B": "டி. பரோ, எம்.பி. எமனோ", "C": "கமில் சுவலபில், ஆந்திரனோவ்", "D": "வீரமாமுனிவர்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 5-இல்: ஸ்டென்கனோ, கே.வி. சுப்பையா, எல்.வி. ராமசுவாமி, பரோ, எமனோ, கமில் சுவலபில், ஆந்திரனோவ், தெ.பொ.மீ ஆகியோர் திராவிட மொழி ஆய்வாளர்களாகக் குறிப்பிடப்பட்டுள்ளனர். வீரமாமுனிவர் அகராதி மற்றும் சிற்றிலக்கியப் புலவர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who among the following is NOT listed in the textbook as a specialized researcher of the Dravidian linguistic family following Caldwell?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Sten Konow, K.V. Subbaiya", "B": "T. Burrow, M.B. Emeneau", "C": "Kamil Zvelebil, Andronov", "D": "Constanzo Beschi (Veeramamunivar)"}, "explanation": "Veeramamunivar contributed to Tamil lexicography and poetry; the textbook lists Sten Konow, Burrow, Emeneau, Zvelebil, and Andronov as subsequent comparative linguists."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 5, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 5", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["scholars", "dravidian_researchers", "direct_mcq"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q017", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-dravida-mozhi-kudumbam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-adi-chorkal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "திராவிட மொழிகளின் 'அடிச்சொற்கள்' (Root Words) குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. திராவிட மொழிகளின் அடிச்சொற்கள் பொதுவாகவே ஒன்றுபோல அமைந்திருக்கும்.\n2. 'கண்' என்னும் அடிச்சொல் மலையாளம் மற்றும் கன்னடத்தில் 'கண்ணு' என்றும், தெலுங்கு மற்றும் குடகில் 'கண்ணு' என்றும் வழங்குகிறது.\n3. குரூக் மொழியில் 'கெண்' என்றும், தோடா மொழியில் 'கொண்' என்றும் இச்சொல் திரிபடைந்துள்ளது.\nமேற்கண்ட கூற்றுகளுள் சரியானவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அனைத்தும் சரி", "B": "1, 2 மட்டும் சரி", "C": "1, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "D": "2, 3 மட்டும் சரி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 6-இல் உள்ள அடிச்சொல் அட்டவணையின்படி மூன்று கூற்றுகளும் முற்றிலும் சரியானவை: கண் (தமிழ்) → கண்ணு (மலையாளம், கன்னடம், தெலுங்கு, குடகு) → கெண் (குரூக்) → கொண் (தோடா)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Analyze the following statements regarding 'Root Words' (அடிச்சொற்கள்) in Dravidian languages:\n1. Root words across Dravidian languages share common etymological origins.\n2. The root word for eye, 'Kan' (கண்), appears as 'Kannu' in Malayalam, Kannada, Telugu, and Kodagu.\n3. It appears as 'Ken' in Kurukh and 'Kon' in Toda.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "All are correct", "B": "1 and 2 only are correct", "C": "1 and 3 only are correct", "D": "2 and 3 only are correct"}, "explanation": "All three statements faithfully reproduce the root word comparison table from textbook page 6."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 6, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 6", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["dravidian_roots", "kan_etymology", "statement_analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q018", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-dravida-mozhi-kudumbam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-kan-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'கண்' என்னும் அடிச்சொல் பல்வேறு திராவிட மொழிகளில் திரிந்துள்ள வடிவங்களைப் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I:\na) தமிழ்\nb) மலையாளம், கன்னடம்\nc) குரூக்\nd) தோடா\n\nபட்டியல் II:\n1. கெண்\n2. கண்\n3. கொண்\n4. கண்ணு", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-4, b-2, c-1, d-3", "B": "a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3", "C": "a-2, b-4, c-3, d-1", "D": "a-1, b-3, c-4, d-2"}, "explanation": "தமிழ் = கண் (2); மலையாளம்/கன்னடம் = கண்ணு (4); குரூக் = கெண் (1); தோடா = கொண் (3). சரியான வரிசை: 2, 4, 1, 3."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the Dravidian tongues with their phonetic form of the root word 'Eye':\nList I: a) Tamil, b) Malayalam & Kannada, c) Kurukh, d) Toda\nList II: 1. Ken, 2. Kan, 3. Kon, 4. Kannu", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-4, b-2, c-1, d-3", "B": "a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3", "C": "a-2, b-4, c-3, d-1", "D": "a-1, b-3, c-4, d-2"}, "explanation": "Tamil: Kan (2); Malayalam/Kannada: Kannu (4); Kurukh: Ken (1); Toda: Kon (3). Order: 2, 4, 1, 3."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 6, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 6", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["dravidian_roots", "matching", "vocabulary"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q019", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-dravida-mozhi-kudumbam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-ennu-peyargal-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'மூன்று' என்ற தமிழெண்ணுப் பெயர் பிற திராவிட மொழிகளில் வழங்கும் வடிவங்களைப் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I:\na) மலையாளம்\nb) தெலுங்கு\nc) கன்னடம்\nd) துளு\n\nபட்டியல் II:\n1. மூடு\n2. மூஜி\n3. மூணு\n4. மூறு", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-4, d-3", "B": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "C": "a-3, b-1, c-4, d-2", "D": "a-4, b-1, c-2, d-3"}, "explanation": "மூன்று: மலையாளம் = மூணு (3); தெலுங்கு = மூடு (1); கன்னடம் = மூறு (4); துளு = மூஜி (2). சரியான பொருத்தம்: 3, 1, 4, 2."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the Dravidian languages with their numeral word for 'Three' (மூன்று):\nList I: a) Malayalam, b) Telugu, c) Kannada, d) Tulu\nList II: 1. Moodu, 2. Mooji, 3. Moonu, 4. Mooru", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-4, d-3", "B": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "C": "a-3, b-1, c-4, d-2", "D": "a-4, b-1, c-2, d-3"}, "explanation": "Malayalam: Moonu (3); Telugu: Moodu (1); Kannada: Mooru (4); Tulu: Mooji (2). Order: 3, 1, 4, 2."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 7, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 7", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["numerals", "dravidian_cognates", "matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q020", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-dravida-mozhi-kudumbam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-naangu-cognates", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'நான்கு' என்ற தமிழ்ச் சொல் கன்னட மொழியில் எவ்வாறு வழங்கப்படுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நாலு", "B": "நாலுகு", "C": "நால்க", "D": "நால்கு"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 7-இல்: நான்கு (தமிழ்), நாலு (மலையாளம்), நால்கு (கன்னடம்), நாலுகு (தெலுங்கு), நாலு (துளு). கன்னடத்தில் 'நால்கு' என வழங்குகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "How is the Tamil numeral 'Naangu' (Four) pronounced in Kannada?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Naalu", "B": "Naalugu", "C": "Naalka", "D": "Naalku"}, "explanation": "In Kannada, four is 'Naalku' (Telugu: Naalugu; Malayalam: Naalu)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 7, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 7", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "