{"id": "9th-u1-q021", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-dravida-mozhi-kudumbam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-ilakkiya-ilakkana-thollai-table", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "திராவிட மொழிகளின் தொன்மையான இலக்கிய இலக்கணங்கள் குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. கன்னட மொழியின் மிகத் தொன்மையான இலக்கிய நூல் 'கவிராஜமார்க்கம்' (கி.பி. 9-ஆம் நூற்றாண்டு).\n2. தெலுங்கு மொழியின் முதல் இலக்கிய நூல் 'பாரதம்' (கி.பி. 11-ஆம் நூற்றாண்டு).\n3. மலையாள மொழியின் மிகத் தொன்மையான இலக்கண நூல் 'லீலாதிலகம்' (கி.பி. 14-ஆம் நூற்றாண்டு).\nமேற்கண்ட கூற்றுகளுள் சரியானவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அனைத்தும் சரி", "B": "1, 2 மட்டும் சரி", "C": "2, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "D": "1, 3 மட்டும் சரி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 8 அட்டவணையின்படி: கன்னடம் (கவிராஜமார்க்கம் கி.பி. 9), தெலுங்கு (பாரதம் கி.பி. 11, இலக்கணம் ஆந்திர பாஷா பூஷணம் கி.பி. 12), மலையாளம் (இலக்கியம் ராமசரிதம் கி.பி. 12, இலக்கணம் லீலாதிலகம் கி.பி. 14). அனைத்துக் கூற்றுகளும் சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Analyze the statements regarding the earliest literature and grammars of Dravidian languages:\n1. The earliest surviving literary work in Kannada is Kavirajamarga (9th century CE).\n2. The earliest literary text in Telugu is the Bharatham by Nannayya (11th century CE).\n3. The earliest grammatical treatise in Malayalam is Lilathilakam (14th century CE).\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "All are correct", "B": "1 and 2 only are correct", "C": "2 and 3 only are correct", "D": "1 and 3 only are correct"}, "explanation": "All three statements faithfully match the official comparative antiquity table on textbook page 8."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 8, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 8", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["literary_antiquity", "table_data", "statement_analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q022", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-dravida-mozhi-kudumbam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-ilakkanam-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "திராவிட மொழிகளையும் அவற்றின் மிகத் தொன்மையான இலக்கண நூல்களையும் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I:\na) தமிழ்\nb) கன்னடம்\nc) தெலுங்கு\nd) மலையாளம்\n\nபட்டியல் II:\n1. ஆந்திர பாஷா பூஷணம்\n2. லீலாதிலகம்\n3. தொல்காப்பியம்\n4. கவிராஜமார்க்கம்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-3, b-1, c-4, d-2", "B": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "C": "a-3, b-4, c-2, d-1", "D": "a-4, b-3, c-1, d-2"}, "explanation": "தமிழ் = தொல்காப்பியம் (3); கன்னடம் = கவிராஜமார்க்கம் (4); தெலுங்கு = ஆந்திர பாஷா பூஷணம் (1); மலையாளம் = லீலாதிலகம் (2). சரியான பொருத்தம்: 3, 4, 1, 2."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match each Dravidian language with its earliest extant grammar treatise:\nList I: a) Tamil, b) Kannada, c) Telugu, d) Malayalam\nList II: 1. Andhra Bhasha Bhushanam, 2. Lilathilakam, 3. Tholkappiyam, 4. Kavirajamarga", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-3, b-1, c-4, d-2", "B": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "C": "a-3, b-4, c-2, d-1", "D": "a-4, b-3, c-1, d-2"}, "explanation": "Tamil: Tholkappiyam (3); Kannada: Kavirajamarga (4); Telugu: Andhra Bhasha Bhushanam (1); Malayalam: Lilathilakam (2). Sequence: 3, 4, 1, 2."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 8, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 8", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar_texts", "comparative_antiquity", "matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q023", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-dravida-mozhi-kudumbam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-kalvettu-saandru", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "திராவிட மொழிகளுள் கி.மு. 3-ஆம் நூற்றாண்டைச் சேர்ந்த மாங்குளம் உள்ளிட்ட பிராமி கல்வெட்டுச் சான்றுகளைக் கொண்டுள்ள ஒரே தொன்மை மொழி எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கன்னடம்", "B": "தெலுங்கு", "C": "தமிழ்", "D": "மலையாளம்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 8-இன் படி, தமிழ் மொழிக்கு மட்டுமே கி.மு. 3-ஆம் நூற்றாண்டுக்குரிய தமிழ் பிராமி கல்வெட்டுச் சான்றுகள் கிடைத்துள்ளன. பிற மொழிகளின் கல்வெட்டுகள் கி.பி. 5 மற்றும் 6-ஆம் நூற்றாண்டுகளுக்குப் பிற்பட்டவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Among the Dravidian languages, which is the only language possessing epigraphical Brahmi rock inscriptions dating as far back as the 3rd century BCE?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kannada", "B": "Telugu", "C": "Tamil", "D": "Malayalam"}, "explanation": "Tamil has rock inscriptions in Tamil-Brahmi dating back to the 3rd century BCE (e.g., Mangulam), earlier than any other Dravidian language."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 8, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 8", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["epigraphy", "tamil_antiquity", "direct_mcq"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q024", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-dravida-mozhi-kudumbam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-foreign-currencies-tamil", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "அயல்நாட்டுப் பணத்தாள்களில் (Currency Notes) தமிழ் மொழி இடம்பெற்றுள்ள நாடுகள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சிங்கப்பூர், மலேசியா", "B": "கனடா, பிரிட்டன்", "C": "மாலத்தீவு, இந்தோனேசியா", "D": "இலங்கை, மொரீசியஸ்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 8 தெரிந்து தெளிவோம் பெட்டிச் செய்தி: 'இலங்கை, மொரீசியஸ் ஆகிய நாடுகளின் பணத்தாள்களில் தமிழ் மொழி இடம்பெற்றுள்ளது'."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In which foreign countries is Tamil printed on the official legal tender currency notes?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Singapore and Malaysia", "B": "Canada and United Kingdom", "C": "Maldives and Indonesia", "D": "Sri Lanka and Mauritius"}, "explanation": "As highlighted in the textbook box on page 8, Tamil is officially printed on the currency notes of Sri Lanka and Mauritius."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 8, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 8", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["tamil_global_presence", "currency_notes", "info_box"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q025", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "assertion_reason", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-dravida-mozhi-kudumbam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-semmozhi-thoguthi", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): தமிழ் மொழி நடுவண் அரசால் 2004-ஆம் ஆண்டு முதல் செம்மொழியாக அறிவிக்கப்பட்டது.\nகாரணம் (R): பிற திராவிட மொழிகளுக்குத் தாய்மொழியாகத் திகழ்வதுடன், தன் தொன்மை, தனித்தன்மை, செழுமையான இலக்கிய வளம் ஆகியவற்றால் உயர்தனிச் செம்மொழித் தகுதியைப் பெற்றுள்ளது.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் சரி; காரணம் கூற்றை விளக்குகிறது", "B": "கூற்று (A) சரி, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) தவறு", "C": "கூற்று (A) தவறு, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) சரி", "D": "கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் தவறு"}, "explanation": "இந்திய அரசால் 2004-இல் முதல் செம்மொழியாக அறிவிக்கப்பட்ட பெருமை தமிழுக்கு உண்டு. தமிழின் தனித்தன்மையும் தொன்மையும் இதற்கு முதன்மைக் காரணங்கள். கூற்று மற்றும் காரணம் இரண்டும் முற்றிலும் சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): Tamil was recognized as the first Classical Language (செம்மொழி) of India in the year 2004.\nReason (R): It serves as the fountainhead of the Dravidian linguistic family, exhibiting unmatched antiquity, autonomous grammatical genius, and classical literary wealth.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are true, and (R) correctly explains (A)", "B": "(A) is true, but (R) is false", "C": "(A) is false, but (R) is true", "D": "Both (A) and (R) are false"}, "explanation": "In 2004, the Government of India accorded Classical status to Tamil due to its supreme antiquity and literary independence. Both statements are accurate."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 8, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 8", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["semmozhi", "classical_tamil", "assertion_reason"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q026", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-dravida-mozhi-kudumbam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-tamilin-thanithanmaigal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழின் தனித்தன்மைகள் குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. பிற திராவிட மொழிகளை விடவும் அதிகமான திராவிடப் பொதுக்கூறுகளைத் தன் அகத்தே கொண்டுள்ள மொழி தமிழ் ஆகும்.\n2. தமிழ் மொழி பிறமொழித் தாக்கமின்றி மிகக் குறைந்த அளவே தனித்து இயங்கக்கூடியது.\n3. ஒரே பொருளைக் குறிக்கப் பல சொற்கள் அமைந்த சொல்வளமும் சொல்லாட்சியும் நிரம்பிய மொழி தமிழ் ஆகும்.\nமேற்கண்டவற்றுள் சரியான கூற்றுகள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1, 2 மட்டும்", "B": "1, 3 மட்டும்", "C": "2, 3 மட்டும்", "D": "அனைத்தும்"}, "explanation": "தமிழ் மொழி பிறமொழித் தாக்கமின்றி 'மிக அதிக அளவில் தனித்தியங்கும் ஆற்றல் கொண்டது' (கூற்று 2-இல் 'குறைந்த அளவு' எனக் கூறப்பட்டுள்ளது தவறு). எனவே 1 மற்றும் 3 சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Examine the statements regarding the unique characteristics of Tamil:\n1. Tamil preserves the greatest proportion of Proto-Dravidian features compared to other sister tongues.\n2. Tamil has very minimal capacity to function independently without relying on loanwords.\n3. Tamil possesses an extraordinary semantic richness with multiple synonymous words denoting a single entity.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 and 2 only", "B": "1 and 3 only", "C": "2 and 3 only", "D": "All 1, 2, and 3"}, "explanation": "Tamil possesses unmatched capability to function autonomously without foreign lexical dependence. Statement 2 is false; 1 and 3 are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 9, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 9", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["tamil_speciality", "linguistic_traits", "statement_analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q027", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-dravida-mozhi-kudumbam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-caldwell-tamil-thanithanmai-quote", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'தமிழ் வடமொழியின் மகளன்று; அது தனிக்குடும்பத்திற்கு உரிய மொழி; சமஸ்கிருதக் கலப்பின்றி அது தனித்தியங்கும் ஆற்றல் பெற்றது' என்று முழங்கியவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஜி.யு. போப்", "B": "வீரமாமுனிவர்", "C": "கால்டுவெல்", "D": "பரிதிமாற்கலைஞர்"}, "explanation": "ராபர்ட் கால்டுவெல் தமது திராவிட மொழிகளின் ஒப்பிலக்கணத்தில், 'தமிழ் வடமொழியின் மகளன்று... சமஸ்கிருதக் கலப்பின்றி அது தனித்தியங்கும் ஆற்றல் பெற்றது மட்டுமன்றி, தலைநிமிர்ந்து நிற்கக்கூடியது' எனக் குறிப்பிட்டார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who declared: 'Tamil is not a daughter of Sanskrit; it belongs to an independent family and possesses the vital power to flourish entirely without Sanskrit loanwords'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "G.U. Pope", "B": "Veeramamunivar", "C": "Dr. Robert Caldwell", "D": "Parithimaar Kalaignar"}, "explanation": "Dr. Robert Caldwell proclaimed this famous statement in his groundbreaking Comparative Grammar (1856)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 9, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 9", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["caldwell", "quotes", "direct_mcq"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q028", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-dravida-mozhi-kudumbam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-ramacharitham-malayalam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "மலையாள மொழியின் மிகத் தொன்மையான இலக்கிய நூலாகக் கருதப்படும் 'ராமசரிதம்' எந்த நூற்றாண்டைச் சேர்ந்தது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கி.பி. 9-ஆம் நூற்றாண்டு", "B": "கி.பி. 10-ஆம் நூற்றாண்டு", "C": "கி.பி. 11-ஆம் நூற்றாண்டு", "D": "கி.பி. 12-ஆம் நூற்றாண்டு"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 8 அட்டவணைப்படி: மலையாளத்தின் முதல் இலக்கிய நூலான 'ராமசரிதம்' கி.பி. 12-ஆம் நூற்றாண்டைச் சேர்ந்ததாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "To which century does 'Ramacharitam', regarded as the earliest extant literary work in Malayalam, belong?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "9th Century CE", "B": "10th Century CE", "C": "11th Century CE", "D": "12th Century CE"}, "explanation": "According to the comparative table on page 8, Malayalam's Ramacharitam dates to the 12th century CE."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 8, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 8", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["malayalam", "ramacharitam", "antiquity_dates"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}

