{"id": "9th-u1-q047", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-dravida-mozhi-kudumbam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-numeral-comparison-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "திராவிட மொழிகளில் வழங்கும் 'பத்து' என்னும் எண்ணுப் பெயரின் வடிவங்களைப் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I:\na) தமிழ்\nb) மலையாளம்\nc) தெலுங்கு\nd) கன்னடம்\n\nபட்டியல் II:\n1. பதி\n2. ஹத்து\n3. பத்து\n4. பத்த்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-3, b-4, c-2, d-1", "B": "a-4, b-3, c-1, d-2", "C": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "D": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4"}, "explanation": "பத்து: தமிழ் = பத்து (3); மலையாளம் = பத்த் (4); தெலுங்கு = பதி (1); கன்னடம் = ஹத்து (2 - 'ப'கரம் 'ஹ'கரமாதல்). சரியான பொருத்தம்: 3, 4, 1, 2."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the Dravidian languages with their cognate forms of the numeral 'Ten':\nList I: a) Tamil, b) Malayalam, c) Telugu, d) Kannada\nList II: 1. Padi, 2. Hatthu, 3. Pathu, 4. Paththu", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-3, b-4, c-2, d-1", "B": "a-4, b-3, c-1, d-2", "C": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "D": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4"}, "explanation": "Tamil: Pathu (3); Malayalam: Paththu (4); Telugu: Padi (1); Kannada: Hatthu (2 - initial 'p' shifts to 'h'). Order: 3, 4, 1, 2."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book"