{"id": "9th-u1-q055", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-dravida-mozhi-kudumbam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-tamil-international-status", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழின் உலகளாவிய நிலை குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. இலங்கை மற்றும் சிங்கப்பூர் நாடுகளில் தமிழ் ஆட்சி மொழிகளில் ஒன்றாகத் திகழ்கிறது.\n2. மொரீசியஸ் நாட்டின் நாணயத் தாள்களில் தமிழ் வரிவடிவம் அச்சிடப்பட்டுள்ளது.\n3. மலேசியாவில் தொடக்கப் பள்ளிகளில் தமிழ் மொழி பயிற்று மொழியாக இடம்பெற்றுள்ளது.\nமேற்கண்ட கூற்றுகளுள் சரியானவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1, 2 மட்டும் சரி", "B": "2, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "C": "அனைத்தும் சரி", "D": "1, 3 மட்டும் சரி"}, "explanation": "இலங்கை/சிங்கப்பூரில் ஆட்சிமொழி; மொரீசியஸ்/இலங்கைப் பணத்தாளில் தமிழ்; மலேசியாவில் தமிழ் வழிக் கல்வி. அனைத்துக் கூற்றுகளும் முற்றிலும் சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Analyze the following statements regarding the international status of Tamil:\n1. Tamil holds official language status in Sri Lanka and Singapore.\n2. Tamil script is featured on the legal tender bank currency notes of Mauritius.\n3. Primary school education is officially imparted in Tamil medium in Malaysia.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 and 2 only are correct", "B": "2 and 3 only are correct", "C": "All 1, 2, and 3 are correct", "D": "1 and 3 only are correct"}, "explanation": "All three statements accurately convey the international standing of the Tamil language."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 8, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 8", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["tamil_global_reach", "currency_notes", "statement_analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q056", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-dravida-mozhi-kudumbam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-leelathilakam-century", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "மலையாள மொழியின் தொன்மையான இலக்கண நூலான 'லீலாதிலகம்' மணிப்பிரவாள நடையில் எந்த நூற்றாண்டில் இயற்றப்பட்டது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கி.பி. 10-ஆம் நூற்றாண்டு", "B": "கி.பி. 11-ஆம் நூற்றாண்டு", "C": "கி.பி. 12-ஆம் நூற்றாண்டு", "D": "கி.பி. 14-ஆம் நூற்றாண்டு"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 8 அட்டவணையின்படி: மலையாள இலக்கண நூல் 'லீலாதிலகம்' கி.பி. 14-ஆம் நூற்றாண்டைச் சேர்ந்ததாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In which century was 'Lilathilakam', the earliest surviving grammatical work of Malayalam (written in Manipravalam style), composed?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "10th Century CE", "B": "11th Century CE", "C": "12th Century CE", "D": "14th Century CE"}, "explanation": "Textbook page 8 comparative table dates Malayalam's grammar Lilathilakam to the 14th century CE."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 8, "chapter": null,