{"id": "9th-u1-q057", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-tamilvidu-thoothu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-thoothu-elakkanam-nool-veli", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ்விடு தூது நூல் மற்றும் தூது இலக்கியம் குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. தமிழ்ச் சிற்றிலக்கிய வகைகளுள் ஒன்றான தூது இலக்கியம் 'வாயில் இலக்கியம்', 'சந்து இலக்கியம்' என்றும் அழைக்கப்படுகிறது.\n2. இது தலைவன் தலைவியருள் ஒருவர் மற்றொருவர் மீது கொண்ட அன்பைக் கூறி வர அன்னம் முதல் வண்டு வரை பத்துப் பொருள்களைத் தூது விடுவதாக அமையும்.\n3. தமிழ்விடு தூது ஆசிரியப்பாவால் இயற்றப்பட்ட நூலாகும்.\nமேற்கண்ட கூற்றுகளுள் சரியானவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1, 2 மட்டும் சரி", "B": "2, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "C": "1, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "D": "அனைத்தும் சரி"}, "explanation": "தூது இலக்கியம் கலிவெண்பாவால் இயற்றப்படுவது ஆகும் (ஆசிரியப்பா அல்ல). எனவே கூற்று 3 தவறு; 1 மற்றும் 2 சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Analyze the statements concerning Tamilvidu Thoothu and Thoothu literature:\n1. Thoothu literature, an integral branch of 96 Sitrilakkiyam genres, is also termed 'Vaayil Ilakkiyam' and 'Sandhu Ilakkiyam'.\n2. It features lovers sending ten emissaries ranging from the swan to the honeybee to convey their affections.\n3. Tamilvidu Thoothu is composed in Asiriyappa poetic meter.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 and 2 only are correct", "B": "2 and 3 only are correct", "C": "1 and 3 only are correct", "D": "All are correct"}, "explanation": "Thoothu poetry is composed strictly in Kalivenba meter, not Asiriyappa. Statement 3 is false; 1 and 2 are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 3, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 3", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["tamilvidu_thoothu", "thoothu_genre", "statement_analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q058", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-tamilvidu-thoothu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-pattudaithalaivan-kannigal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ்விடு தூது எந்தத் தெய்வத்தின் மீது பாடப்பட்டது? இந்நூலில் உள்ள மொத்தக் கண்ணிகள் எத்தனை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "திருச்செந்தூர் முருகன் மீது; 250 கண்ணிகள்", "B": "மதுரை சொக்கநாதர் மீது; 268 கண்ணிகள்", "C": "தஞ்சைப் பெருவுடையார் மீது; 260 கண்ணிகள்", "D": "சிதம்பரம் நடராசர் மீது; 300 கண்ணிகள்"}, "explanation": "தமிழ்விடு தூது மதுரையில் எழுந்தருளியுள்ள சொக்கநாதர் மீது காதல் கொண்ட பெண் ஒருத்தி பாடியது; இந்நூல் 268 கண்ணிகளைக் கொண்டது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "On which presiding deity is Tamilvidu Thoothu dedicated, and how many rhyming couplets (Kannigal) does it contain?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Lord Murugan of Tiruchendur; 250 Kannigal", "B": "Lord Chokkanathar of Madurai; 268 Kannigal", "C": "Lord Brihadisvara of Thanjavur; 260 Kannigal", "D": "Lord Nataraja of Chidambaram; 300 Kannigal"}, "explanation": "Tamilvidu Thoothu is addressed to Lord Chokkanathar of Madurai and comprises exactly 268 couplets."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 3, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 3", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["tamilvidu_thoothu", "chokkanathar", "kannigal_count"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q059", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-tamilvidu-thoothu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-uvesa-pathippu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ்விடு தூது நூலை 1930-ஆம் ஆண்டு முதன்முதலில் அச்சுப் பதிப்பாக வெளியிட்ட தமிழறிஞர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சி.வை. தாமோதரம்பிள்ளை", "B": "மறைமலையடிகள்", "C": "உ.வே. சாமிநாதையர்", "D": "ரா.பி. சேதுப்பிள்ளை"}, "explanation": "தமிழ் தாத்தா உ.வே. சாமிநாதையர் 1930-இல் தமிழ்விடு தூது நூலை முதன்முதலில் பதிப்பித்து வெளியிட்டார்; இந்நூலின் ஆசிரியர் பெயர் அறியப்படவில்லை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which eminent Tamil savant first edited and published Tamilvidu Thoothu in print format in the year 1930?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "C.W. Damodaram Pillai", "B": "Maraimalai Adigal", "C": "U.V. Swaminatha Iyer (U.Ve.Sa)", "D": "R.P. Sethu Pillai"}, "explanation": "Dr. U.V. Swaminatha Iyer recovered and edited the palm-leaf manuscript of Tamilvidu Thoothu in 1930."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 3, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 3", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["tamilvidu_thoothu", "uvesa", "direct_mcq"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q060", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-tamilvidu-thoothu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-kanni-vilakkam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ் இலக்கியத்தில் 'கண்ணி' என்பது குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. இரண்டு கண்களைப் போல இரண்டு இரண்டு பூக்களை வைத்துத் தொடுக்கப்படும் மாலைக்குக் 'கண்ணி' என்று பெயர்.\n2. செய்யுளில் இரண்டிரண்டு அடிகள் கொண்ட எதுகையால் தொடுக்கப்படும் செய்யுள் பகுதி 'கண்ணி' எனப்படும்.\n3. தமிழ்விடு தூது வெண்பா யாப்பில் உள்ளதால் கண்ணி என்று அழைக்கப்படுவதில்லை.\nமேற்கண்ட கூற்றுகளுள் சரியானவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அனைத்தும் சரி", "B": "2, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "C": "1, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "D": "1, 2 மட்டும் சரி"}, "explanation": "தமிழ்விடு தூது கலிவெண்பாவின் இரண்டிரண்டு அடிகளால் எதுகை அமையப் பெற்ற 'கண்ணிகளால்' பாடப்பட்டது (கூற்று 3 தவறு). 1 மற்றும் 2 சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Examine the statements defining 'Kanni' in Tamil poetics:\n1. Just as two flowers are strung in pairs like two eyes to weave a garland, such a floral string is termed 'Kanni'.\n2. In prosody, couplets formed by two lines sharing identical initial rhyme (edhugai) are called 'Kanni'.\n3. Tamilvidu Thoothu couplets are not called Kannigal because of their Venba meter.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "All are correct", "B": "2 and 3 only are correct", "C": "1 and 3 only are correct", "D": "1 and 2 only are correct"}, "explanation": "The 268 couplets of Tamilvidu Thoothu are explicitly termed Kannigal. Statement 3 is false; 1 and 2 are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 3, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 3", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["tamilvidu_thoothu", "kanni_definition", "statement_analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q061", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "quote_completion", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-tamilvidu-thoothu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-thithikkum-thellamudhai-poem", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'தித்திக்கும் தெள்ளமுதாய் தெள்ளமுதின் மேலான\nமுத்திக் கனியேஎன் முத்தமிழே...'\nஇவ்வடிகளில் 'முத்திக்கனி' என்பது எவ்வகை இலக்கணக் குறிப்பைக் குறிக்கிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உருவகம்", "B": "உவமைத்தொகை", "C": "பண்புத்தொகை", "D": "வினையெச்சம்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 3 இலக்கணக் குறிப்பு: முத்திக் கனி = உருவகம் (முத்தியாகிய கனி). முத்தமிழ் = பண்புத்தொகை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the opening couplet of Tamilvidu Thoothu, 'Muthikkaniye En Muthamizhe', what grammatical device does 'Muthikkani' represent?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Metaphor (Uruvagam)", "B": "Simile Compound (Uvamaithogai)", "C": "Descriptive Compound (Panbuthogai)", "D": "Adverbial Participle (Vinaiyecham)"}, "explanation": "'Muthikkani' (fruit of liberation) is an absolute metaphor (Uruvagam) specified on textbook page 3."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 2, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 2", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["tamilvidu_thoothu", "ilakkana_kurippu", "quote_completion"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q062", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-tamilvidu-thoothu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-moovinam-thuthor", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'குறமென்றும் பள்ளென்றும் கொள்வார் கொடுப்பாய்க்கு\nஉறவென்று மூன்று இனத்தும் உண்டோ...'\nஇப்பாடல் அடியில் குறிப்பிடப்படும் 'மூன்று இனம்' என்பவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தமிழ், தெலுங்கு, கன்னடம்", "B": "துறை, தாழிசை, விருத்தம்", "C": "இயல், இசை, நாடகம்", "D": "அறம், பொருள், இன்பம்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் சொல்லும் பொருளும்: மூன்று இனம் = பாவினங்கள் ஆகிய துறை, தாழிசை, விருத்தம் என்பனவாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the couplet 'Uravendru Moondru Inathum Undoo', what do the 'Three Inams' (மூன்று இனம்) refer to?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Tamil, Telugu, and Kannada", "B": "Thurai, Thaazhisai, and Viruttham", "C": "Iyal, Isai, and Naadagam", "D": "Aram, Porul, and Inbam"}, "explanation": "The three poetic sub-meters (Paavinangal) are Thurai, Thaazhisai, and Viruttham."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 2, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 2", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["tamilvidu_thoothu", "moovinam", "literary_terms"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q063", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-tamilvidu-thoothu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-sindhamani-sinthu-pun", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'சிந்தாமணியாய் இருந்த உனைச் சிந்து என்று சொல்லிய நாச் சிந்துமே' — இத்தொடரில் 'சிந்து' என்னும் சொல் குறிக்கும் இருவேறு பொருள்கள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சிந்து நதி ; சிந்து சமவெளி", "B": "சிந்தனை ; கவலை", "C": "இசைப்பாடல் வகை ; அழிதல் / கெடுதல்", "D": "சிறுமை ; பெருமை"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பொருள்: 'சிந்து' என்பது ஒரு வகை இசைப்பாடலைக் குறிக்கும்; அதே சொல் 'நாச் சிந்துமே' என்னும்போது 'நாக்கு கீழே விழுந்து அழியும்' என்ற அழிதல் பொருளைத் தருகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the line 'Sindhamaniyaai Irundha Unai Sindhu Endru Solliya Naach Sindhumey', what are the two distinct meanings of the punned word 'Sindhu'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "River Indus; Indus Valley", "B": "Contemplation; Melancholy", "C": "A musical poetic meter (Sindhu); Ruin / dropping off", "D": "Smallness; Greatness"}, "explanation": "'Sindhu' refers to both an egalitarian folksy musical form and phonologically warns that the blasphemous tongue will rot and fall off."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 2, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 2", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["tamilvidu_thoothu", "silayedai_pun", "vocabulary"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q064", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-tamilvidu-thoothu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-gunangal-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ்விடு தூது விளக்கும் குணங்களையும் அவற்றின் எண்ணிக்கையையும் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I:\na) வானில் வாழும் முத்தேவர்கள் பெற்ற குணங்கள்\nb) குற்றமில்லாத தமிழ் பெற்றுள்ள குணங்கள்\nc) மனிதரால் உண்டாக்கப்பட்ட வண்ணங்கள்\nd) தமிழின் புலவர்கள் கண்ட வண்ணங்கள்\n\nபட்டியல் II:\n1. பத்து குணங்கள் (செறிவு, தெளிவு...)\n2. மூன்று குணங்கள் (சத்துவம், ராசசம், தாமசம்)\n3. நூறு வண்ணங்கள் (குறில், அகவல்...)\n4. ஐந்து வண்ணங்கள் (வெண்மை, செம்மை...)", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-4, d-3", "B": "a-3, b-1, c-2, d-4", "C": "a-2, b-3, c-1, d-4", "D": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3"}, "explanation": "தேவர்கள் பெற்ற குணம் = 3 (சத்துவம், ராசசம், தாமசம்); தமிழின் குணம் = 10 (செறிவு, தெளிவு...); மனிதர் வண்ணம் = 5; புலவர் கண்ட தமிழின் வண்ணம் = 100. வரிசை: 2, 1, 4, 3."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the attributes in Tamilvidu Thoothu with their corresponding enumerations:\nList I: a) Qualities of celestial Devas, b) Qualities possessed by faultless Tamil, c) Colors created by mortal humans, d) Poetic rhythms (Vannangal) identified in Tamil\nList II: 1. Ten qualities (Clarity, Compactness...), 2. Three Gunas (Sattva, Rajas, Tamas), 3. Hundred meters/rhythms, 4. Five colors (White, Red, Black, Yellow, Green)", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-4, d-3", "B": "a-3, b-1, c-2, d-4", "C": "a-2, b-3, c-1, d-4", "D": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3"}, "explanation": "Devas: 3 Gunas (2); Tamil: 10 Qualities (1); Mortal colors: 5 (4); Tamil poetic colors: 100 (3). Order: 2, 1, 4, 3."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 2, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 2", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["tamilvidu_thoothu", "gunangal_vannangal", "matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q065", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "assertion_reason", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-tamilvidu-thoothu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-suvaigal-vanappu-assertion", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): மனிதர் நாவினால் அறியும் சுவைகள் ஆறு மட்டுமே; ஆனால் தமிழ் கொண்டுள்ள அழியா அழகோ (வனப்பு) எட்டாகும்.\nகாரணம் (R): அம்மை, அழகு, தொன்மை, தோல், விருந்து, இயைபு, புலன், இழைபு ஆகிய எட்டையும் தமிழின் வனப்புகள் எனத் தொல்காப்பிய இலக்கணம் கூறுகிறது.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் சரி; காரணம் கூற்றை விளக்குகிறது", "B": "கூற்று (A) சரி, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) தவறு", "C": "கூற்று (A) தவறு, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) சரி", "D": "கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் தவறு"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 2: நாவின் சுவை ஆறு; தமிழின் அழியா வனப்பு எட்டு (அம்மை முதலானவை). கூற்று மற்றும் காரணம் இரண்டும் முற்றிலும் சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): Mortal tongues know only six mundane tastes (Aru Suvai), but Tamil is adorned with eight everlasting aesthetic beauties (Vanappu).\nReason (R): Tholkappiyam enumerates these eight poetic beauties as Ammai, Azhagu, Thonmai, Thol, Virundhu, Iyaibu, Pulan, and Izhaibu.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are correct, and (R) correctly explains (A)", "B": "(A) is correct, but (R) is false", "C": "(A) is false, but (R) is true", "D": "Both (A) and (R) are false"}, "explanation": "Both (A) and (R) are factually correct and elucidate the contrast drawn in Tamilvidu Thoothu."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 2, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 2", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["tamilvidu_thoothu", "eight_vanappu", "assertion_reason"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q066", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-tamilvidu-thoothu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-sol-porul-tamilvidu-thoothu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ்விடு தூதுப் பாடலின் 'சொல்லும் பொருளும்' குறித்த பின்வரும் இணைகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. குறம், பள்ளு - சிற்றிலக்கிய வகைகள்\n2. ஊனரசம் - குறையுடைய சுவை\n3. வனப்பு - புகழ்\nமேற்கண்டவற்றுள் சரியான இணைகள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அனைத்தும் சரி", "B": "1, 2 மட்டும் சரி", "C": "2, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "D": "1, 3 மட்டும் சரி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் சொல்லும் பொருள்: வனப்பு = அழகு (புகழ் அல்ல). எனவே இணை 3 தவறு; 1 மற்றும் 2 சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Examine the glossary pairs from the Tamilvidu Thoothu lesson:\n1. Kuram, Pallu - Genres of minor literature (Sitrilakkiyam)\n2. Oonarasam - Deficient / mundane taste\n3. Vanappu - Fame\nWhich pairs are correctly matched?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "All are correct", "B": "1 and 2 only are correct", "C": "2 and 3 only are correct", "D": "1 and 3 only are correct"}, "explanation": "'Vanappu' strictly means aesthetic beauty (அழகு), not fame. Pairs 1 and 2 are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 2, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 2", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["tamilvidu_thoothu", "glossary", "statement_analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q067", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-tamilvidu-thoothu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-kuttramila-ilakkanam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'குற்றமிலா' மற்றும் 'சிந்தாமணி' ஆகிய சொற்களுக்குரிய சரியான இலக்கணக் குறிப்பு யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பண்புத்தொகை", "B": "உரிச்சொற்றொடர்", "C": "ஈறுகெட்ட எதிர்மறைப் பெயரெச்சம்", "D": "வினையாலணையும் பெயர்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 3 இலக்கணக் குறிப்பு: குற்றமிலா (குற்றமில்லாத), சிந்தாமணி (சிந்தாத மணி) என்பன ஈற்று 'த' கெட்டு நின்றதால் 'ஈறுகெட்ட எதிர்மறைப் பெயரெச்சங்கள்' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the grammatical classification of the terms 'Kuttramila' and 'Sindhamani' in the poem?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Qualitative Compound (Panbuthogai)", "B": "Intensifier Phrase (Urisortodar)", "C": "Negative Relative Participle with dropped terminal consonant (Eeruketta Ethirmarai Peyarecham)", "D": "Participial Noun (Vinaiyaalanaiyum Peyar)"}, "explanation": "Both words drop the terminal 'dhu' (kuttramilladha → kuttramila), making them classic examples of Eeruketta Ethirmarai Peyarecham."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 3, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 3", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["tamilvidu_thoothu", "ilakkana_kurippu", "direct_mcq"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q068", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-tamilvidu-thoothu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-thoothu-porulgal-pathu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "மரபுசார்ந்த தூது இலக்கியங்களில் தூது விடுவதற்குரிய பத்துப் பொருள்களுள் சேராத ஒன்றைக் கண்டறிக:", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அன்னம், மயில், கிளி", "B": "மேகம், வண்டு, தென்றல்", "C": "குயில், நெஞ்சம், தமிழ்", "D": "யானை, குதிரை"}, "explanation": "தூது இலக்கியத்தில் அன்னம், மயில், கிளி, மேகம், வண்டு, தென்றல், குயில், நெஞ்சம், தமிழ், மான் முதலான 10 பொருள்களே தூதுவிடப்படும். யானை மற்றும் குதிரை தூதுப் பொருள்களுள் அடங்காது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Identify the objects that are NOT part of the conventional ten traditional emissary objects used in Thoothu literature:", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Swan, Peacock, Parrot", "B": "Cloud, Bee, Breeze", "C": "Cuckoo, Heart/Mind, Tamil", "D": "Elephant, Horse"}, "explanation": "Traditional Thoothu poetic conventions admit swans, parrots, bees, winds, clouds, etc., but never large war animals like elephants or horses."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 3, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 3", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["thoothu_conventions", "odd_one_out", "direct_mcq"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q069", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "quote_completion", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-tamilvidu-thoothu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-sevigal-unavaana-line", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'செவிகள் உணவான நன்சுவை அமுதத்தை நுகர்ந்தோர் யார்?' என்று தமிழ்விடு தூது கூறுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சான்றோர்கள் (புலவர்கள்)", "B": "விண்ணுலக முத்தேவர்கள்", "C": "பொதுமக்கள்", "D": "அரசர்கள்"}, "explanation": "பாடலின் பொருள்: விண்ணில் உள்ள தேவர்கள் உண்ணும் அமுதத்தை விடச் சான்றோர்களின் செவிகளுக்குத் தமிழே நன்சுவை விருந்தாக அமைகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to Tamilvidu Thoothu, who are the fortunate connoisseurs who relish Tamil as the divine ambrosia for their ears?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Learned Scholars and Sages (சான்றோர்கள்)", "B": "Celestial Trinity Gods of Heaven", "C": "Commoners", "D": "Monarchs and Emperors"}, "explanation": "The poem states that while gods consume heavenly nectar, true scholars partake in the immortal nectar of Tamil through their ears."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-