{"id": "9th-u1-q070", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-tamilvidu-thoothu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-kalivenba-lakkanam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கலிவெண்பா மற்றும் தூது இலக்கியத் தொடர்பு குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. தூது இலக்கியங்கள் அனைத்தும் வெண்பாவின் வகைகளுள் ஒன்றான கலிவெண்பாவால் பாடப்படும் இலக்கண மரபு கொண்டவை.\n2. கலிவெண்பாவின் இரண்டிரண்டு அடிகள் எதுகையால் தொடுக்கப்படுவது கண்ணி என அழைக்கப்படுகிறது.\n3. தமிழ்விடு தூதில் உள்ள 268 கண்ணிகளும் ஒரே ஆசிரியரால் வெவ்வேறு நூற்றாண்டுகளில் தொகுக்கப்பட்டவை.\nமேற்கண்ட கூற்றுகளுள் தவறான கூற்று எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 மற்றும் 2", "B": "3 மட்டும்", "C": "1 மற்றும் 3", "D": "எதுவுமில்லை"}, "explanation": "தமிழ்விடு தூது ஒரே புலவரால் (பெயர் அறியப்படாத புலவர்) மதுரையில் பாடப்பட்ட முழுமையான நூலாகும்; பல நூற்றாண்டுகளில் தொகுக்கப்பட்டது அல்ல (கூற்று 3 தவறானது)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Examine the statements regarding Kalivenba meter and Thoothu literature:\n1. All classical Thoothu works strictly adhere to Kalivenba meter.\n2. Pairs of rhyming couplets sharing edhugai rhyme in Kalivenba are known as Kannigal.\n3. The 268 Kannigal of Tamilvidu Thoothu were compiled by multiple authors across different centuries.\nWhich statement is INCORRECT?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 and 2", "B": "3 only", "C": "1 and 3", "D": "None of the above"}, "explanation": "Tamilvidu Thoothu is a single unified work by an anonymous author, not a multi-century anthology. Statement 3 is incorrect."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 3, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 3", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["tamilvidu_thoothu", "kalivenba", "statement_analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q071", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-tamilvidu-thoothu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-ilakkana-sol-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ்விடு தூதுப் பாடலில் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள சொற்களையும் அவற்றின் இலக்கணக் குறிப்புகளையும் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I:\na) முத்திக்கனி\nb) தெள்ளமுது\nc) குற்றமிலா\nd) செவிகள்\n\nபட்டியல் II:\n1. ஈறுகெட்ட எதிர்மறைப் பெயரெச்சம்\n2. பெயர்ச்சொல்\n3. உருவகம்\n4. பண்புத்தொகை", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-4, b-3, c-1, d-2", "B": "a-3, b-1, c-4, d-2", "C": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "D": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4"}, "explanation": "முத்திக்கனி = உருவகம் (3); தெள்ளமுது = பண்புத்தொகை (4); குற்றமிலா = ஈறுகெட்ட எதிர்மறைப் பெயரெச்சம் (1); செவிகள் = பெயர்ச்சொல் (2). சரியான பொருத்தம்: 3, 4, 1, 2."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the words from Tamilvidu Thoothu with their grammatical attributes:\nList I: a) Muthikkani, b) Thellamudhu, c) Kuttramila, d) Sevigal\nList II: 1. Negative relative participle with dropped coda, 2. Noun, 3. Metaphor (Uruvagam), 4. Descriptive compound (Panbuthogai)", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-4, b-3, c-1, d-2", "B": "a-3, b-1, c-4, d-2", "C": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "D": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4"}, "explanation": "Muthikkani: Metaphor (3); Thellamudhu: Panbuthogai (4); Kuttramila: Eeruketta Ethirmarai Peyarecham (1); Sevigal: Noun (2). Order: 3, 4, 1, 2."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 3, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 3", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["tamilvidu_thoothu", "ilakkana_kurippu", "matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q072", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-tamilvidu-thoothu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-uvesa-year", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "உ.வே. சாமிநாதையர் தமிழ்விடு தூது நூலை அச்சேற்றிய ஆண்டு எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1920", "B": "1925", "C": "1928", "D": "1930"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 3 நூல் வெளி: 'இந்நூலை 1930-இல் உ.வே.சா. முதன்முதலில் பதிப்பித்தார்'."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In which year did U.V. Swaminatha Iyer publish the first printed edition of Tamilvidu Thoothu?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1920", "B": "1925", "C": "1928", "D": "1930"}, "explanation": "Textbook page 3 confirms that U.Ve.Sa printed and released Tamilvidu Thoothu in 1930."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 3, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 3", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["tamilvidu_thoothu", "uvesa", "publication_year"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q073", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-tamilvidu-thoothu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-poetic-colors-vannangal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ் பெற்றுள்ள 'நூறு வண்ணங்கள்' குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. மனிதரால் உண்டாக்கப்பட்ட வண்ணங்கள் வெண்மை, செம்மை, கருமை, பொன்மை, பசுமை என ஐந்தே ஆகும்.\n2. புலவர்கள் கண்ட தமிழின் வண்ணங்கள் குறில், அகவல், தூங்கிசை, மெல்லிசை உள்ளிட்ட நூறு வண்ணங்களைக் கொண்டதாகும்.\n3. தமிழ்விடு தூது பாடலில் கூறப்படும் நூறு வண்ணங்கள் ஓவியக் கலைக்குரிய வண்ணங்களாகும்.\nமேற்கண்ட கூற்றுகளுள் சரியானவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1, 2 மட்டும் சரி", "B": "2, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "C": "1, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "D": "அனைத்தும் சரி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பொருள்: தமிழின் நூறு வண்ணங்கள் என்பது செய்யுளின் ஓசை மற்றும் சந்த நயங்களைக் குறிக்கும் (ஓவிய வண்ணங்கள் அல்ல; கூற்று 3 தவறு). 1 மற்றும் 2 சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Analyze the statements regarding the 'Hundred Poetic Colors' (நூறு வண்ணங்கள்) of Tamil:\n1. Man-made visual colors are strictly five: White, Red, Black, Yellow, and Green.\n2. Ancient Tamil bards discovered one hundred prosodic rhythms/colors (Vannangal) like Kuril, Agaval, Thoongisai, and Mellisai.\n3. The hundred colors described in Tamilvidu Thoothu refer to visual oil painting pigments.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 and 2 only are correct", "B": "2 and 3 only are correct", "C": "1 and 3 only are correct", "D": "All are correct"}, "explanation": "In Tamil poetics, 'Vannam' signifies rhythmic acoustic cadences (not painting paints). Statements 1 and 2 are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 2, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 2", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["tamilvidu_thoothu", "poetic_rhythms", "statement_analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q074", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-tamilvidu-thoothu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-thoothu-request", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ்விடு தூதில் தலைவி, மதுரை சொக்கநாதரிடம் சென்று தமிழிடம் என்ன வாங்கி வருமாறு வேண்டுகோள் விடுக்கிறாள்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மாணிக்க மணிமாலை", "B": "வேப்பம்பூ மாலை", "C": "பொற்றாமரை மாலை", "D": "செண்பகப்பூ மாலை"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 2: மதுரை சொக்கநாதர் சூடியுள்ள 'வேப்பம்பூ மாலையை' வாங்கி வருமாறு தமிழாகிய தூதினிடம் தலைவி அன்போடு வேண்டுகிறாள்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In Tamilvidu Thoothu, what token of love does the heroine instruct the Tamil emissary to secure from Lord Chokkanathar of Madurai?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Ruby garland", "B": "Neem flower garland (வேப்பம்பூ மாலை)", "C": "Golden Lotus garland", "D": "Champaka flower garland"}, "explanation": "The heroine beseeches the Tamil emissary to fetch the cool fragrant garland of neem blossoms worn by Lord Chokkanathar of the Pandya realm."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition"