{"id": "9th-u1-q080", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-tamilvidu-thoothu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-kannigal-numbers-trap", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ்விடு தூது நூலின் பதிப்பு மற்றும் வடிவம் குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. இந்நூலில் மொத்தம் 268 கண்ணிகள் உள்ளன.\n2. உ.வே.சா. இதனை முதன்முதலில் 1930-இல் ஏட்டுச் சுவடியிலிருந்து அச்சிட்டுப் பதிப்பித்தார்.\n3. இந்நூலின் ஆசிரியர் மதுரை சொக்கநாதப் புலவர் ஆவார்.\nமேற்கண்டவற்றுள் தவறான கூற்று எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 மட்டும்", "B": "2 மட்டும்", "C": "1 மற்றும் 2", "D": "3 மட்டும்"}, "explanation": "தமிழ்விடு தூதின் ஆசிரியர் பெயர் அறியப்படவில்லை (மதுரை சொக்கநாதப் புலவர் அல்ல; சொக்கநாதர் என்பது பாட்டுடைத் தலைவன்). எனவே கூற்று 3 தவறானது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Examine the statements regarding the publication and structure of Tamilvidu Thoothu:\n1. The work contains exactly 268 rhyming couplets (Kannigal).\n2. U.Ve.Sa retrieved and published it from palm-leaf manuscripts in 1930.\n3. The author of the text was Madurai Chokkanatha Pulavar.\nWhich statement is FALSE?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 only", "B": "2 only", "C": "1 and 2", "D": "3 only"}, "explanation": "The author is anonymous. Chokkanathar is the divine hero of the poem, not the author. Statement 3 is false."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 3, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 3", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["tamilvidu_thoothu", "facts_check", "statement_analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q081", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-tamilvidu-thoothu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-muthamizh-definition", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'முத்திக் கனியேஎன் முத்தமிழே' — இதில் 'முத்தமிழ்' எனப் போற்றப்படுவன எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இயல், இசை, நாடகம்", "B": "அறம், பொருள், இன்பம்", "C": "துறை, தாழிசை, விருத்தம்", "D": "இறந்தகாலம், நிகழ்காலம், எதிர்காலம்"}, "explanation": "முத்தமிழ் என்பது இயல் தமிழ், இசைத் தமிழ், நாடகத் தமிழ் ஆகிய மூன்று பிரிவுகளைக் குறிக்கும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the line 'Muthikkaniye En Muthamizhe', what constitutes the revered triad 'Muthamizh'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Iyal, Isai, and Naadagam (Literature, Music, Drama)", "B": "Aram, Porul, and Inbam (Virtue, Wealth, Love)", "C": "Thurai, Thaazhisai, and Viruttham (Poetic sub-meters)", "D": "Past, Present, and Future"}, "explanation": "Muthamizh traditionally denotes the three classic dimensions: Iyal (literary), Isai (musical), and Naadagam (theatrical)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 2, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 2", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["muthamizh", "basics", "direct_mcq"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q082", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-tamilvidu-thoothu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-96-sitrilakkiyam-thoothu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சிற்றிலக்கிய மரபு குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. தமிழில் சிற்றிலக்கிய வகைகள் 96 என்று பிரபந்த மரபியல் உள்ளிட்ட பாட்டியல் நூல்கள் கூறுகின்றன.\n2. தூது, உலா, பரணி, பிள்ளைத்தமிழ், கலம்பகம், குறவஞ்சி, பள்ளு ஆகியவை சிற்றிலக்கிய வகைகளில் அடங்கும்.\n3. தமிழ்விடு தூது எட்டுத்தொகை நூல்களுள் ஒன்றாகும்.\nமேற்கண்டவற்றுள் சரியான கூற்றுகள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அனைத்தும் சரி", "B": "1, 2 மட்டும் சரி", "C": "2, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "D": "1, 3 மட்டும் சரி"}, "explanation": "தமிழ்விடு தூது சிற்றிலக்கிய வகையைச் சேர்ந்தது (எட்டுத்தொகை நூல் அல்ல; கூற்று 3 தவறு). 1 மற்றும் 2 சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Examine the statements regarding the Sitrilakkiyam tradition:\n1. Classical prosody treatises like Prabhandha Marabiyal categorize 96 genres of minor literature.\n2. Thoothu, Ula, Parani, Pillaithamizh, Kalambagam, Kuravanji, and Pallu belong to Sitrilakkiyam.\n3. Tamilvidu Thoothu is an anthology work belonging to the Ettuthogai corpus.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "All are correct", "B": "1 and 2 only are correct", "C": "2 and 3 only are correct", "D": "1 and 3 only are correct"}, "explanation": "Tamilvidu Thoothu is a Sitrilakkiyam, not an Ettuthogai Sangam work. Statements 1 and 2 are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 3, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 3", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["sitrilakkiyam", "prabhandham", "statement_analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q083", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-tamilvidu-thoothu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-vandu-thoothu-phrase", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ்விடு தூதில் 'உன்னிடம் நான் மகிழ்ந்து விடுக்கும் வேண்டுகோள் ஒன்றுள்ளது' என்று உரைப்பவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சொக்கநாதப் பெருமான்", "B": "உ.வே. சாமிநாதையர்", "C": "சொக்கநாதரிடம் அன்பு கொண்ட தலைவி", "D": "தமிழ்த்தாய்"}, "explanation": "பாடலின் தொடக்க வரிகளில்: மதுரையில் எழுந்தருளியுள்ள சொக்கநாதரிடம் பேரன்பு பூண்ட தலைவி, தமிழிடம் தனது மனக் குறையைக் கூறி மாலையை வாங்கி வருமாறு வேண்டுகிறாள்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In Tamilvidu Thoothu, who speaks the opening lines: 'I have a single earnest prayer which I gladly entrust to you'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Lord Chokkanathar", "B": "Dr. U.V. Swaminatha Iyer", "C": "The smitten heroine in love with Lord Chokkanathar", "D": "Mother Tamil"}, "explanation": "The lovesick heroine of Madurai addresses these poignant opening lines directly to Mother Tamil."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 2, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 2", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["tamilvidu_thoothu", "speaker_identification", "direct_mcq"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q084", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-tamilvidu-thoothu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-kalivenba-traits", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ்விடு தூது இயற்றப்பட்டுள்ள 'கலிவெண்பா' எவ்வகை யாப்பு விதிகளுக்கு உட்பட்டு அமையும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஆசிரியப்பாவின் அகவல் ஓசை", "B": "வஞ்சிப்பாவின் தூங்கலோசை", "C": "கலிப்பாவின் துள்ளலோசை", "D": "வெண்பாவின் செப்பலோசை மற்றும் வெண்டளை விதிகள்"}, "explanation": "கலிவெண்பா என்பது வெண்பாவின் ஒரு வகையாகும். இது வெண்டளையால் அமைந்து, வெண்பாவிற்குரிய செப்பலோசை கொண்டு இரண்டிரண்டு அடிகளாய் வரும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Under which fundamental prosodic rules is Kalivenba (the meter of Tamilvidu Thoothu) composed?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Agaval rhythm of Asiriyappa", "B": "Thoongal rhythm of Vanjippa", "C": "Thullal rhythm of Kalippa", "D": "Seppal rhythm and Vendalai rules of Venba"}, "explanation": "Kalivenba is a specialized elongated variety of Venba characterized by Seppal rhythm and Vendalai metric linkages."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year",