{"id": "9th-u1-q090", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-04-aaram-thinai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-vadakku-veethi-award", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "அ. முத்துலிங்கத்தின் எந்தச் சிறுகதைத் தொகுதி இலங்கை அரசின் சாகித்திய விருதினைப் பெற்றது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அக்கா", "B": "வடக்கு வீதி", "C": "வம்சவிருத்தி", "D": "திகடசக்கரம்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 15: அ. முத்துலிங்கத்தின் 'வடக்கு வீதி' என்னும் சிறுகதைத் தொகுதி 1999-ஆம் ஆண்டில் இலங்கை அரசின் சாகித்திய விருதைப் பெற்றது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which short story anthology of A. Muthulingam was conferred the Sahitya Award by the Government of Sri Lanka in 1999?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Akka", "B": "Vadakku Veethi", "C": "Vamsaviruthi", "D": "Thigadasakkaram"}, "explanation": "'Vadakku Veethi' (Northern Street) won the prestigious Sri Lankan Sahitya Award in 1999."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 15, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 15", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["aaram_thinai", "muthulingam_awards", "direct_mcq"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q091", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-04-aaram-thinai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-aaram-thinai-concept", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பண்டைத் தமிழரின் ஐந்திணைகள் (குறிஞ்சி, முல்லை, மருதம், நெய்தல், பாலை) தவிர்த்து, அ. முத்துலிங்கம் குறிப்பிடும் 'ஆறாம் திணை' என்பது எதனைக் குறிக்கிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "விண்வெளிப் பயணம்", "B": "கடல் கடந்த வணிகம்", "C": "பனிப் பிரதேசம் மற்றும் புலம்பெயர்ந்த தமிழர் வாழும் நிலம்", "D": "மலை சார்ந்த நிலம்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 12-15: பனி படர்ந்த கனடா மற்றும் உலகெங்கும் தமிழர்கள் புலம்பெயர்ந்து அகதிகளாகவும் உழைப்பாளர்களாகவும் வாழும் புலம்பெயர் வாழ்விடங்களையே முத்துலிங்கம் 'ஆறாம் திணை' என்கிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In addition to the classical five Tamil landscapes (Ainthinai), what does the 'Sixth Landscape' (ஆறாம் திணை) denote in A. Muthulingam's prose?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Outer Space Exploration", "B": "Trans-oceanic Trade Routes", "C": "Sub-zero snowy realms and the global diaspora lands where Tamils live as migrants and refugees", "D": "Mountainous Forested Tracts"}, "explanation": "Muthulingam terms the snow-bound countries (like Canada) and diaspora homelands of displaced Tamils as the 'Sixth Landscape'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 12, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 12", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["aaram_thinai", "concept", "direct_mcq"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q092", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-04-aaram-thinai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-tamil-population-global", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'தமிழர்கள் எட்டுக்கோடிப் பேர் உலகம் முழுவதும் வாழ்கிறார்கள்' என்று கூறும் ஆறாம் திணை உரைப்பகுதி குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. உலகெங்கும் பரவி வாழும் தமிழர்களின் எண்ணிக்கை ஏறத்தாழ எட்டு கோடியாகும்.\n2. தமிழர்கள் நியூசிலாந்திலிருந்து கனடாவின் அலாஸ்கா எல்லை வரை பரவி வாழ்கின்றனர்.\n3. கனடாவில் தமிழர்கள் ஒருபோதும் சொந்த மொழிப் பத்திரிகைகளையோ வானொலிகளையோ நடத்தவில்லை.\nமேற்கண்ட கூற்றுகளுள் சரியானவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அனைத்தும் சரி", "B": "2, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "C": "1, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "D": "1, 2 மட்டும் சரி"}, "explanation": "கனடாவில் தமிழர்கள் பல பத்திரிகைகளையும், வானொலி மற்றும் தொலைக்காட்சிகளையும் வெற்றிகரமாக நடத்தி வருகின்றனர் (கூற்று 3 தவறு). 1 மற்றும் 2 சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Examine the statements regarding the global Tamil diaspora in 'Aaram Thinai':\n1. Approximately 80 million Tamils live dispersed across the globe today.\n2. The diaspora spans from New Zealand all the way to Alaska near the Arctic.\n3. Tamils in Canada have never established their own Tamil newspapers or community radio stations.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "All are correct", "B": "2 and 3 only are correct", "C": "1 and 3 only are correct", "D": "1 and 2 only are correct"}, "explanation": "Tamils in Canada operate multiple newspapers, TV channels, and 24-hour radio stations. Statement 3 is false; 1 and 2 are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 15, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 15", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["aaram_thinai", "diaspora_facts", "statement_analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q093", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "assertion_reason", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-04-aaram-thinai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-mount-lavinia-story", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): அ. முத்துலிங்கம் கொழும்பின் மவுண்ட் லவினியா கடற்கரை வீட்டில் தங்கியிருந்த போது 1958-ஆம் ஆண்டு கலவரத்தில் வீட்டை விட்டு வெளியேற நேர்ந்தது.\nகாரணம் (R): ஓர் இரவில் ஒரு பெட்டியுடன் புறப்பட்ட அந்தப் பயணமே பல நாடுகளில் புலம்பெயர்ந்து வாழும் தொடர் வாழ்க்கையின் தொடக்கப் புள்ளியாக அமைந்தது.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் சரி; காரணம் கூற்றை விளக்குகிறது", "B": "கூற்று (A) சரி, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) தவறு", "C": "கூற்று (A) தவறு, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) சரி", "D": "கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் தவறு"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 12: 1958 இனக்கலவரத்தின் போது மவுண்ட் லவினியாவில் தொடங்கிய இடப்பெயர்வே அவரது உலகளாவிய புலம்பெயர்தலின் துவக்கம். கூற்று மற்றும் காரணம் இரண்டும் முற்றிலும் சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): While residing in a rented house at Mount Lavinia in Colombo, A. Muthulingam had to flee during the 1958 ethnic violence.\nReason (R): That abrupt midnight flight with a single suitcase marked the inception of his lifelong journey across different continents.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are true, and (R) correctly explains (A)", "B": "(A) is true, but (R) is false", "C": "(A) is false, but (R) is true", "D": "Both (A) and (R) are false"}, "explanation": "Both statements accurately narrate the autobiographical opening of 'Aaram Thinai' on page 12."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 12, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 12", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["aaram_thinai", "mount_lavinia", "assertion_reason"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q094", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-03-tamiloviyam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-tamilanban-iyarpeyar", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஈரோடு தமிழன்பனின் இயற்பெயர் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ராஜகோபாலன்", "B": "ஜெகதீசன்", "C": "சுப்புரத்தினம்", "D": "துரைராசு"}, "explanation": "ஈரோடு தமிழன்பனின் இயற்பெயர் 'ஜெகதீசன்' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the real given name (இயற்பெயர்) of modern poet Erode Tamilanban?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Rajagopalan", "B": "Jagadeesan", "C": "Subburathinam", "D": "Durairasu"}, "explanation": "Erode Tamilanban's birth name is Jagadeesan."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 11, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 11", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["erode_tamilanban", "iyarpeyar", "direct_mcq"], "la