{"id": "9th-u1-q099", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-04-aaram-thinai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-muthulingam-books-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "அ. முத்துலிங்கத்தின் படைப்புகளையும் அவற்றுக்குரிய விருதுகளையும் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I:\na) அக்கா\nb) வம்சவிருத்தி\nc) வடக்கு வீதி\nd) திகடசக்கரம்\n\nபட்டியல் II:\n1. இலங்கை அரசின் சாகித்திய பரிசு (1999)\n2. கட்டுரை/சிறுகதைத் தொகுதி\n3. தமிழக அரசின் முதல் பரிசு\n4. தமிழ்நாடு அரசின் பரிசு (1999)", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-4, b-3, c-1, d-2", "B": "a-3, b-1, c-4, d-2", "C": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "D": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4"}, "explanation": "அக்கா = தமிழக அரசு முதல் பரிசு (3); வம்சவிருத்தி = தமிழக அரசு பரிசு 1999 (4); வடக்கு வீதி = இலங்கை சாகித்திய பரிசு 1999 (1); திகடசக்கரம் = சிறுகதைத் தொகுதி (2). வரிசை: 3, 4, 1, 2."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the literary collections of A. Muthulingam with their respective accolades:\nList I: a) Akka, b) Vamsaviruthi, c) Vadakku Veethi, d) Thigadasakkaram\nList II: 1. Sri Lanka Sahitya Award (1999), 2. Short story / essay work, 3. Tamil Nadu Govt First Prize, 4. Tamil Nadu Govt Award (1999)", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-4, b-3, c-1, d-2", "B": "a-3, b-1, c-4, d-2", "C": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "D": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4"}, "explanation": "Akka: TN Govt 1st Prize (3); Vamsaviruthi: TN Govt 1999 (4); Vadakku Veethi: Sri Lanka Sahitya 1999 (1); Thigadasakkaram: (2). Sequence: 3, 4, 1, 2."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 15, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 15", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["muthulingam", "matching", "literary_works"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q100", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-04-aaram-thinai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-diaspora-media", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஆறாம் திணை பாடப்பகுதியில், 'புலம்பெயர்ந்த தமிழர்கள் தங்கள் பண்பாட்டையும் மொழியையும் பாதுகாக்க என்னென்ன அமைப்புகளை நிறுவியுள்ளனர்?' எனக் குறிப்பிடப்படுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தொழிற்சாலைகள்", "B": "வணிக வளாகங்கள்", "C": "சுற்றுலா மையங்கள்", "D": "தமிழ்ப் பள்ளிகள், நூலகங்கள், பத்திரிகைகள், வானொலிகள்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 14: வெளிநாடுகளில் புலம்பெயர்ந்து வாழும் தமிழர்கள் வார இறுதித் தமிழ்ப் பள்ளிகள், பண்பாட்டு நூலகங்கள், நாளிதழ்கள் மற்றும் வானொலிகள் மூலம் மொழியைத் தலைமுறை தோறும் காத்து வருகின்றனர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to 'Aaram Thinai', what community institutions have diaspora Tamils established abroad to preserve language and heritage?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Automobile factories", "B": "Shopping plazas", "C": "Tourist resorts", "D": "Weekend Tamil language schools, community libraries, journals, and radio stations"}, "explanation": "Diaspora Tamils preserve their maternal heritage by operating weekend Tamil schools, cultural libraries, and local broadcasting media."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 14, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 14", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["aaram_thinai", "cultural_preservation", "direct_mcq"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q101", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-03-tamiloviyam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-tamilanban-verse-forms", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஈரோடு தமிழன்பனின் கவிதை வடிவங்கள் குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. இவர் 'ஹைக்கூ' என்னும் ஜப்பானிய வடிவத்தைத் தமிழில் செழுமைப்படுத்தியவர்களில் ஒருவர்.\n2. அங்கதச் சுவை நிரம்பிய 'சென்ரியூ' கவிதைகளையும் இவர் இயற்றியுள்ளார்.\n3. 'லிமரைக்கூ' என்னும் வடிவத்திலும் கவிதைகளைத் தந்துள்ளார்.\nமேற்கண்ட கூற்றுகளுள் சரியானவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அனைத்தும் சரி", "B": "1, 2 மட்டும் சரி", "C": "2, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "D": "1, 3 மட்டும் சரி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 11 நூல் வெளி: ஹைக்கூ, சென்ரியூ, லிமரைக்கூ ஆகிய மூன்றிலும் நூல்களைத் தந்துள்ளார். எனவே அனைத்தும் சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Analyze the poetic experiments of Erode Tamilanban:\n1. He is among the prime figures who enriched the Japanese Haiku form in Tamil.\n2. He composed satirical Senryu poems reflecting socio-political realities.\n3. He also authored collections in the hybrid Limeraiku verse form.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "All are correct", "B": "1 and 2 only are correct", "C": "2 and 3 only are correct", "D": "1 and 3 only are correct"}, "explanation": "All three statements faithfully state Tamilanban's multi-genre poetic versatility documented on page 11."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 11, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 11", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["erode_tamilanban", "poetic_forms", "statement_analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
