{"id": "9th-u1-q106", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-04-aaram-thinai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-1958-kalavaram-year", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஆறாம் திணை பாடப்பகுதியில் ஆசிரியர் அ. முத்துலிங்கம் கொழும்பில் தாம் சந்தித்ததாகக் குறிப்பிடும் இனக்கலவர ஆண்டு எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1947", "B": "1958", "C": "1971", "D": "1983"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 12: '1958-ஆம் ஆண்டு கலவரத்தில் மவுண்ட் லவினியா வீட்டிலிருந்து வெளியேற நேர்ந்தது' என்று முத்துலிங்கம் குறிப்பிடுகிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In 'Aaram Thinai', which specific year of ethnic rioting in Colombo is cited by A. Muthulingam as the beginning of his displacement?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1947", "B": "1958", "C": "1971", "D": "1983"}, "explanation": "Page 12 explicitly dates his family's initial evacuation from Mount Lavinia to the 1958 riots."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 12, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 12", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "pr