{"id": "9th-u1-q107", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-03-tamiloviyam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-tamilanban-literary-thought", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'மானிட மேன்மையை மட்டுமே பாடும் குறள் தந்தது தமிழே' என்று தமிழோவியத்தில் போற்றப்படும் நூல் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நாலடியார்", "B": "தொல்காப்பியம்", "C": "திருக்குறள்", "D": "சிலப்பதிகாரம்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 10: 'எத்தனை எத்தனை சமயங்கள்... மானிட மேன்மையை மட்டுமே பாடும் திருக்குறள் தந்தது தமிழே!' எனத் திருக்குறளைப் போற்றுகிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In 'Tamiloviyam', which seminal masterwork is hailed as the universal text that solely extols the moral nobility of humanity irrespective of sectarian religion?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Naaladiyaar", "B": "Tholkappiyam", "C": "Thirukkural", "D": "Silappathikaram"}, "explanation": "The poem explicitly praises Thirukkural for championing universal human dignity above dogmatic religious divisions."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 10, "ch