{"id": "9th-u1-q108", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-04-aaram-thinai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-eight-crore-tamils", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஆறாம் திணை பாடநூல் பகுதியின்படி உலகம் முழுவதும் வாழும் தமிழர்களின் மொத்த மக்கள் தொகை எவ்வளவு எனக் குறிக்கப்பட்டுள்ளது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஐந்து கோடி", "B": "ஆறு கோடி", "C": "ஏழு கோடி", "D": "எட்டுக் கோடி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 15: 'தமிழர்கள் எட்டுக்கோடிப் பேர் உலகம் முழுவதும் இருக்கிறார்கள்' என்று பாடநூல் தெளிவாகக் குறிப்பிடுகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to the textbook lesson 'Aaram Thinai', what is the estimated global population of Tamils living worldwide?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "50 Million (5 Crores)", "B": "60 Million (6 Crores)", "C": "70 Million (7 Crores)", "D": "80 Million (8 Crores)"}, "explanation": "Textbook page 15 states that 80 million (8 crores) Tamils live distributed across the globe."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 15, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tam