{"id": "9th-u1-q109", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-03-tamiloviyam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-tamilanban-vision", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழோவியம் கவிதையில் தமிழ்மொழியின் பன்முகத்தன்மை குறித்துக் கூறப்பட்டுள்ள கருத்துகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. இலக்கணப் பெட்டகமாகத் திகழும் தமிழே, வாழ்வியலின் நெறிமுறைகளை வகுத்துரைக்கிறது.\n2. ஏணி போல் உயர்ந்து மானிடப் பொதுமைக்கு வழிகாட்டுகிறது.\n3. காலந்தோறும் புதிய புதிய இலக்கிய வடிவங்களைத் தன்னுள் ஏற்றுப் புதுப்பித்துக் கொள்கிறது.\nமேற்கண்ட கூற்றுகளுள் சரியானவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அனைத்தும் சரி", "B": "1, 2 மட்டும் சரி", "C": "2, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "D": "1, 3 மட்டும் சரி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 10 தமிழோவியத்தின் மையக்கருத்துப்படி மூன்று கூற்றுகளும் தமிழின் காலந்தோறும் புதுப்பிக்கும் பேராற்றலைச் சரியாக விளக்குகின்றன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Analyze the poetic themes regarding Tamil's dynamic nature in 'Tamiloviyam':\n1. As a treasure trove of grammar, it illuminates the ethical codes of human living.\n2. It acts as a spiritual ladder lifting humanity toward universal brotherhood.\n3. It continuously renews itself by embracing new literary forms across epochs.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "All are correct", "B": "1 and 2 only are correct", "C": "2 and 3 only are correct", "D": "1 and 3 only are correct"}, "explanation": "All three statements capture the core literary and philosophical ethos of Tamiloviyam."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 10, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 10", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["tamiloviyam", "themes", "statement_analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q110", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-04-aaram-thinai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-thigadasakkaram-author", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'திகடசக்கரம்' என்னும் நூலை எழுதிய புகழ்பெற்ற ஈழத்து எழுத்தாளர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "எஸ். பொன்னுத்துரை", "B": "அ. முத்துலிங்கம்", "C": "கே. கணேஷ்", "D": "ஈழத்து சிவானந்தன்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 15 நூல் வெளி: 'திகடசக்கரம் முதலான பல நூல்களை எழுதியுள்ளார் அ. முத்துலிங்கம்'."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who is the acclaimed Eelam Tamil writer who authored the literary work 'Thigadasakkaram'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "S. Ponnuthurai", "B": "A. Muthulingam", "C": "K. Ganesh", "D": "Eelathu Sivanandhan"}, "explanation": "Textbook page 15 lists 'Thigadasakkaram' among the notable books authored by A. Muthulingam."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 15, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 15", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exa