{"id": "9th-u1-q115", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-05-eluthu-alapedai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-alapedai-matching-examples", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "உயிரளபெடை வகைகளையும் அவற்றுக்குரிய பொருத்தமான சான்றுகளையும் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I:\na) செய்யுளிசை அளபெடை (மொழி முதல்)\nb) செய்யுளிசை அளபெடை (மொழி இடை)\nc) இன்னிசை அளபெடை\nd) சொல்லிசை அளபெடை\n\nபட்டியல் II:\n1. கெடுப்பதூஉம்\n2. உரனசைஇ\n3. ஓஒதல் வேண்டும்\n4. உராஅர்க்கு உறுநோய்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-4, b-3, c-1, d-2", "B": "a-3, b-4, c-2, d-1", "C": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "D": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4"}, "explanation": "செய்யுளிசை (முதல்) = ஓஒதல் (3); செய்யுளிசை (இடை) = உராஅர்க்கு (4); இன்னிசை = கெடுப்பதூஉம் (1); சொல்லிசை = உரனசைஇ (2). சரியான வரிசை: 3, 4, 1, 2."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the varieties of Uyiralapedai with their illustrative textbook examples:\nList I: a) Seyyulisai (Word initial), b) Seyyulisai (Word medial), c) Innisai Alapedai, d) Sollisai Alapedai\nList II: 1. Keduppadhooum, 2. Uranasaii, 3. Ooodhal vendum, 4. Uraarkku urunoi", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-4, b-3, c-1, d-2", "B": "a-3, b-4, c-2, d-1", "C": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "D": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4"}, "explanation": "Seyyulisai initial: Ooodhal (3); Seyyulisai medial: Uraarkku (4); Innisai: Keduppadhooum (1); Sollisai: Uranasaii (2). Order: 3, 4, 1, 2."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 16, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 16", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "uyiralapedai", "matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q116", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-05-eluthu-alapedai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-seyyulisai-rules", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "செய்யுளிசை அளபெடை குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. செய்யுளில் ஓசை குறையும் போது அதனை நிறைவு செய்ய நெட்டெழுத்துகள் ஏழும் அளபெடுக்கும்.\n2. இதற்கு 'இசைநிறை அளபெடை' என்ற மற்றொரு பெயரும் உண்டு.\n3. இது மொழி முதல், மொழி இடை, மொழி கடை ஆகிய மூன்று இடங்களிலும் வரும்.\nமேற்கண்ட கூற்றுகளுள் சரியானவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1, 2 மட்டும் சரி", "B": "2, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "C": "1, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "D": "அனைத்தும் சரி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 16: செய்யுளிசை அளபெடை ஓசை குறையும் போது வரும்; இசைநிறை அளபெடை எனப்படும்; மொழி முதல் (ஓஒதல்), இடை (உராஅர்க்கு), கடை (படாஅ) ஆகிய மூவிடங்களிலும் வரும். அனைத்தும் சரி."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Analyze the statements regarding Seyyulisai (Isainirai) Alapedai:\n1. When the acoustic meter falls short in verse, the seven long vowels elongate.\n2. It is also known by the synonymous name 'Isainirai Alapedai'.\n3. It occurs in word-initial, word-medial, and word-terminal positions.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 and 2 only are correct", "B": "2 and 3 only are correct", "C": "1 and 3 only are correct", "D": "All 1, 2, and 3 are correct"}, "explanation": "All three statements faithfully state the prosodic behavior of Seyyulisai Alapedai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 16, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 16", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "seyyulisai", "statement_analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q117", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-05-eluthu-alapedai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-sollisai-alapedai-concept", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'உரனசைஇ உள்ளம் துணையாகச் சென்றார்\nவரனசைஇ இன்னும் உளேன்'\nஇக்குறட்பாவில் பயின்றுவந்துள்ள அளபெடை எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சொல்லிசை அளபெடை", "B": "செய்யுளிசை அளபெடை", "C": "இன்னிசை அளபெடை", "D": "ஒற்றளபெடை"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 16: 'நசை' என்னும் பெயர்ச்சொல் 'நசைஇ' (விரும்பி) என்னும் வினையெச்சப் பொருளைத் தருவதற்காக 'இ' அளபெடுத்து வந்துள்ளதால் இது 'சொல்லிசை அளபெடை' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the Kural couplet 'Uranasaii Ullam Thunaiyaaga Sendraar Varanasaii Innum Ulen', what type of Alapedai is exemplified by 'Uranasaii'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Sollisai Alapedai", "B": "Seyyulisai Alapedai", "C": "Innisai Alapedai", "D": "Otralapedai"}, "explanation": "The noun 'Nasai' (desire) shifts into an adverbial participle 'Nasaii' (desiring) via vowel elongation, defining Sollisai Alapedai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edi