{"id": "9th-u1-q118", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-05-eluthu-alapedai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-innisai-alapedai-rules", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இன்னிசை அளபெடை குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. செய்யுளில் ஓசை குறையாத இடத்திலும் இனிய ஓசைக்காக அளபெடுப்பது இன்னிசை அளபெடையாகும்.\n2. இதில் குறில் எழுத்து நெடிலாக மாறி, பின்னர் அளபெடுத்து ஒலிக்கும்.\n3. 'கெடுப்பதூஉம்', 'எடுப்பதூஉம்' என்பன இன்னிசை அளபெடைக்குரிய சிறந்த சான்றுகளாகும்.\nமேற்கண்ட கூற்றுகளுள் சரியானவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1, 2 மட்டும்", "B": "அனைத்தும் சரி", "C": "2, 3 மட்டும்", "D": "1, 3 மட்டும்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 16: ஓசை குறையாத இடத்திலும் இனிய ஓசைக்காகக் குறில் நெடிலாகி (கெடுப்பதும் → கெடுப்பதூஉம்) அளபெடுப்பதே இன்னிசை அளபெடை. மூன்று கூற்றுகளும் முற்றிலும் சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Examine the statements defining Innisai Alapedai:\n1. It elongates not because the meter is deficient, but purely to impart euphonic musicality.\n2. A short vowel lengthens into a long vowel and then takes an adjoining short vowel marker.\n3. 'Keduppadhooum' and 'Eduppadhooum' are textbook paradigms of Innisai Alapedai.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 and 2 only", "B": "All 1, 2, and 3 are correct", "C": "2 and 3 only", "D": "1 and 3 only"}, "explanation": "All three statements faithfully articulate the mechanism of Innisai Alapedai from page 16."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 16, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 16", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "innisai_alapedai", "statement_analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q119", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-05-eluthu-alapedai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-otralapedai-letters-count", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஒற்றளபெடையில் அளபெடுக்கும் மொத்த எழுத்துகளின் எண்ணிக்கை எத்தனை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "8 எழுத்துகள்", "B": "10 எழுத்துகள்", "C": "11 எழுத்துகள்", "D": "18 எழுத்துகள்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 16: மெல்லின மெய்கள் 6 (ங், ஞ், ண், ந், ம், ன்) + இடையின மெய்கள் 4 (ய், ர் நீங்கலாக: ய், ல், வ், ள்) + ஆய்த எழுத்து 1 (ஃ) = மொத்தம் 11 எழுத்துகள் ஒற்றளபெடையில் அளபெடுக்கும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "How many total consonant and dependent letters are eligible to undergo Otralapedai (Consonantal Elongation)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "8 letters", "B": "10 letters", "C": "11 letters", "D": "18 letters"}, "explanation": "11 letters total: 6 nasals (ங், ஞ், ண், ந், ம், ன்) + 4 semivowels/liquids (ய், ல், வ், ள்) + 1 Aytham (ஃ)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 16, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 16", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "otralapedai", "letters_count"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q120", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-05-eluthu-alapedai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-non-alapedai-letters", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பின்வரும் எழுத்துகளுள் ஒற்றளபெடையில் ஒருபோதும் அளபெடுக்காத எழுத்துத் தொகுதி எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ங், ஞ், ண்", "B": "ய், வ், ல்", "C": "ம், ன், ள்", "D": "க், ச், ட், த், ப், ற் மற்றும் ர், ழ்"}, "explanation": "வல்லின மெய்கள் ஆறும் (க், ச், ட், த், ப், ற்) மற்றும் இடையினத்தில் ர், ழ் ஆகிய இரண்டும் (மொத்தம் 8 எழுத்துகள்) ஒருபோதும் அளபெடுப்பதில்லை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which group of consonants NEVER undergoes metric elongation in Otralapedai?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ங், ஞ், ண்", "B": "ய், வ், ல்", "C": "ம், ன், ள்", "D": "Hard plosives (க், ச், ட், த், ப், ற்) along with ர் and ழ்"}, "explanation": "The 6 hard plosives (Vallinam) plus 'r' and 'zh' (total 8 consonants) never elongate in Tamil prosody."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 16, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 16", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "otralapedai", "odd_one_out"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q121", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-05-eluthu-alapedai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-otralapedai-idangal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஒற்றளபெடை சொல்லில் இடம்பெறும் இடங்கள் குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. ஒற்றளபெடை மொழிக்கு முதலிலும் இடையிலும் கடையிலும் ஆகிய மூன்று இடங்களிலும் வரும்.\n2. ஒற்றளபெடை மொழிக்கு இடையில் குறிலை அடுத்தும் குறிலிணையை அடுத்தும் மட்டுமே வரும்.\n3. சொல்லின் இறுதியில் தனிக்குறிலை அடுத்து ஒற்றளபெடை வருவதில்லை.\nமேற்கண்ட கூற்றுகளுள் தவறான கூற்று எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 மட்டும் தவறானது", "B": "2 மட்டும் தவறானது", "C": "3 மட்டும் தவறானது", "D": "எதுவுமில்லை"}, "explanation": "ஒற்றளபெடை மொழிக்கு முதலில் ஒருபோதும் வராது (கூற்று 1 தவறு). மெய்யெழுத்து சொல்லின் முதலில் வராது என்பதால் ஒற்றளபெடை மொழி இடை மற்றும் கடையில் மட்டுமே வரும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Examine the statements regarding the positional occurrence of Otralapedai:\n1. Otralapedai occurs in all three positions: word-initial, word-medial, and word-final.\n2. It occurs medially following a single short syllable or twin short syllables.\n3. It does not occur immediately following an isolated short syllable at word end.\nWhich statement is INCORRECT?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Statement 1 only is incorrect", "B": "Statement 2 only is incorrect", "C": "Statement 3 only is incorrect", "D": "None of the above"}, "explanation": "Consonants never initiate a word in Tamil phonotactics; hence Otralapedai can never be word-initial. Statement 1 is false."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 16, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 16", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "otralapedai_positions", "statement_analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q122", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-05-eluthu-alapedai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-ayutha-otralapedai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'எஃஃகிலங்கிய கையறாஅ அன்பினாய்'\nஇவ்வடியில் 'எஃஃகு' என்பதில் அமைந்துள்ள அளபெடை எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உயிரளபெடை", "B": "ஆய்த ஒற்றளபெடை", "C": "சொல்லிசை அளபெடை", "D": "இசைநிறை அளபெடை"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 16: ஆய்த எழுத்து (ஃ) செய்யுளில் ஓசை குறையும் போது அளபெடுத்து 'எஃஃகு' என இரண்டு ஆய்தமாக வருவதால் இது 'ஆய்த ஒற்றளபெடை' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the line 'Eh-h-kilangiya Kaiyaraa Anbinaai', what grammatical device does 'Eh-h-ku' (எஃஃகு) illustrate?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Uyiralapedai", "B": "Ayutha Otralapedai", "C": "Sollisai Alapedai", "D": "Isainirai Alapedai"}, "explanation": "The duplication of the Aytham letter (ஃஃ) to satisfy meter constitutes Ayutha Otralapedai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 16, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 16", "url": n