{"id": "9th-u1-q123", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-05-eluthu-alapedai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-maathirai-alavugal-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "எழுத்துகளின் வகைகளையும் அவற்றுக்குரிய மாத்திரை அளவுகளையும் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I:\na) குறில் எழுத்து\nb) நெடில் எழுத்து\nc) அளபெடுத்த உயிரெழுத்து\nd) ஒற்றளபெடை\n\nபட்டியல் II:\n1. 3 மாத்திரை\n2. 1 மாத்திரை (1/2 + 1/2)\n3. 2 மாத்திரை\n4. 1 மாத்திரை", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-4, b-3, c-2, d-1", "B": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "C": "a-4, b-3, c-1, d-2", "D": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3"}, "explanation": "குறில் = 1 மாத்திரை (4); நெடில் = 2 மாத்திரை (3); அளபெடுத்த உயிர் = 3 மாத்திரை (1); ஒற்றளபெடை = 1 மாத்திரை (2 - அரை+அரை). சரியான பொருத்தம்: 4, 3, 1, 2."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the letter categories with their exact metrical durations (Maathirai):\nList I: a) Short vowel (Kuril), b) Long vowel (Nedil), c) Elongated vowel (Uyiralapedai), d) Elongated consonant (Otralapedai)\nList II: 1. 3 Maathirais, 2. 1 Maathirai (1/2 + 1/2), 3. 2 Maathirais, 4. 1 Maathirai", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-4, b-3, c-2, d-1", "B": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "C": "a-4, b-3, c-1, d-2", "D": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3"}, "explanation": "Kuril = 1 (4); Nedil = 2 (3); Uyiralapedai = 3 (1); Otralapedai = 1 (2). Order: 4, 3, 1, 2."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 16, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 16", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "maathirai", "matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q124", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-05-eluthu-alapedai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-padaa-kadaisi-alapedai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'நல்ல படாஅ பறை' — இத்தொடரில் 'படாஅ' என்னும் சொல் எந்த இடத்தில் அளபெடுத்துள்ளது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மொழி முதல்", "B": "மொழி இடை", "C": "முதல் மற்றும் இடை", "D": "மொழி கடை (இறுதி)"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 16: 'படாஅ' என்பதில் சொல்லின் ஈற்றெழுத்தான 'டா' (ட்+ஆ) நெடில் அளபெடுத்து 'அ' பெற்றுள்ளதால் இது மொழி இறுதி (கடை) அளபெடையாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the classical phrase 'Nalla Padaa Parai', in which position of the word does the vowel in 'Padaa' (படாஅ) elongate?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Word-initial", "B": "Word-medial", "C": "Both initial and medial", "D": "Word-final (மொழி கடை)"}, "explanation": "In 'Padaa' (படாஅ), the terminal syllable 'daa' elongates at the end of the word (Kadai)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 16, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 16", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "alapedai_positions", "direct_mcq"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q125", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "assertion_reason", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-05-eluthu-alapedai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-sollisai-semantic-shift", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): சொல்லிசை அளபெடையில் நெட்டெழுத்து அளபெடுப்பது ஓசைக்காக மட்டுமன்றி, சொல்லின் இலக்கணப் பாத்திரத்தை மாற்றுவதற்காகவும் நிகழ்கிறது.\nகாரணம் (R): 'நசை' என்னும் பெயர்ச்சொல் 'நசைஇ' என்று அளபெடுக்கும் போது 'விரும்பி' என்ற வினையெச்சப் பொருளாக மாறுகிறது.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் சரி; காரணம் கூற்றை விளக்குகிறது", "B": "கூற்று (A) சரி, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) தவறு", "C": "கூற்று (A) தவறு, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) சரி", "D": "கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் தவறு"}, "explanation": "சொல்லிசை அளபெடையின் தனிச்சிறப்பே பெயர்ச்சொல்லை வினையெச்சமாக மாற்றுவதுதான். கூற்று மற்றும் காரணம் இரண்டும் முற்றிலும் சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): In Sollisai Alapedai, vowel elongation occurs not merely for acoustic meter but to transform the grammatical part of speech of the word.\nReason (R): When the noun 'Nasai' (affection) elongates into 'Nasaii', it transforms semantically into an adverbial participle meaning 'having desired'.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are true, and (R) correctly explains (A)", "B": "(A) is true, but (R) is false", "C": "(A) is false, but (R) is true", "D": "Both (A) and (R) are false"}, "explanation": "Both statements accurately define the unique morphological-semantic function of Sollisai Alapedai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 16, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 16", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "sollisai", "assertion_reason"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q126", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-05-eluthu-alapedai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-otralapedai-non-eligible", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஒற்றளபெடையில் இடம்பெறாத எழுத்துகள் குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. க், ச், ட், த், ப், ற் ஆகிய 6 வல்லின மெய்களும் ஒற்றளபெடையில் அளபெடுப்பதில்லை.\n2. இடையின மெய்களான ர், ழ் ஆகிய இரண்டும் ஒற்றளபெடையில் அளபெடுப்பதில்லை.\n3. மெல்லின மெய்களுள் 'ண்', 'ன்' ஆகிய இரண்டும் ஒற்றளபெடையில் அளபெடுப்பதில்லை.\nமேற்கண்ட கூற்றுகளுள் சரியானவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "B": "1, 2 மட்டும் சரி", "C": "2, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "D": "அனைத்தும் சரி"}, "explanation": "மெல்லின மெய்கள் ஆறும் (ண், ன் உட்பட) ஒற்றளபெடையில் அளபெடுக்கும் (கூற்று 3 தவறு). வல்லினம் 6 + ர், ழ் (மொத்தம் 8) மட்டுமே அளபெடுக்காது. எனவே 1 மற்றும் 2 சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Analyze the statements concerning consonants ineligible for Otralapedai:\n1. The six hard plosives (க், ச், ட், த், ப், ற்) never elongate in Otralapedai.\n2. The medial consonants 'r' (ர்) and 'zh' (ழ்) never elongate in Otralapedai.\n3. Among nasals, 'nn' (ண்) and 'n' (ன்) never elongate in Otralapedai.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 and 3 only are correct", "B": "1 and 2 only are correct", "C": "2 and 3 only are correct", "D": "All are correct"}, "explanation": "All six nasals do elongate. Only the 6 hard plosives plus 'r' and 'zh' are ineligible. Statements 1 and 2 are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 16, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 16", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "otralapedai_rules", "statement_analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q127", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-05-eluthu-alapedai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-innisai-identification", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'கெடுப்பதூஉம் கெட்டார்க்குச் சார்வாய்மற் றாங்கே\nஎடுப்பதூஉம் எல்லாம் மழை'\nஇத்திருக்குறளில் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள 'கெடுப்பதூஉம்' என்பது எவ்வகை அளபெடை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சொல்லிசை அளபெடை", "B": "செய்யுளிசை அளபெடை", "C": "இன்னிசை அளபெடை", "D": "ஒற்றளபெடை"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 16: 'கெடுப்பதும்' என்பது மூன்று சீராய் நின்றாலும் ஓசை குறையாத இடத்தில் இனிய ஓசைக்காகத் தூஉம் என அளபெடுத்ததால் இது 'இன்னிசை அளபெடை' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the Kural 'Keduppadhooum Kettaarkku Chaarvaaimat Raangey Eduppadhooum Ellaam Mazhai', what type of Alapedai is 'Keduppadhooum'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Sollisai Alapedai", "B": "Seyyulisai Alapedai", "C": "Innisai Alapedai", "D": "Otralapedai"}, "explanation": "'Keduppadhum' elongates into 'Keduppadhooum' solely for euphonic harmony, making it Innisai Alapedai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 16, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 16", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "kural_grammar", "direct_mcq"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q128", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-05-eluthu-alapedai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-ina-eluthu-alapedai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "உயிரளபெடையில் 'ஐ' மற்றும் 'ஔ' ஆகிய நெட்டெழுத்துகள் அளபெடுக்கும் போது அவற்றுக்கு இனமாக முறையே எந்தக் குறில்கள் பின்னே வரும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அ , ஆ", "B": "எ , ஒ", "C": "உ , இ", "D": "இ , உ"}, "explanation": "நன்னூல் & இலக்கண விதி: ஐகாரத்திற்கு இணையாக 'இ'கரமும், ஔகாரத்திற்கு இணையாக 'உ'கரமும் அளபெடையின் பின்னே வரும் (எ.கா: ஐயர் → அஇயர் / கை → கஇ ; ஔவை → அஉவை)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In Uyiralapedai, which short vowel companion letters trail behind the diphthongs 'Ai' and 'Au' respectively?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a and aa", "B": "e and o", "C": "u and i", "D": "i and u (இ and உ)"}, "explanation": "Phonologically, 'i' serves as the harmonic offglide companion to 'Ai', and 'u' serves as the companion to 'Au'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 16, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 16", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "diphthongs", "ina_eluthu"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q129", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-05-eluthu-alapedai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-thanvinai-piravinai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தொடர் இலக்கணத்தில் தன்வினை, பிறவினை குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. எழுவாய் ஒரு வினையைத் தானே செய்வது தன்வினை எனப்படும் (எ.கா: பந்து உருண்டது).\n2. எழுவாய் ஒரு வினையை பிறரைக் கொண்டு செய்விப்பது பிறவினை எனப்படும் (எ.கா: பந்தை உருட்டினான்).\n3. தன்வினைகள் 'வி', 'பி' போன்ற விகுதிகளைப் பெற்று மட்டுமே வரும்.\nமேற்கண்ட கூற்றுகளுள் சரியானவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1, 2 மட்டும் சரி", "B": "2, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "C": "1, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "D": "அனைத்தும் சரி"}, "explanation": "'வி', 'பி' போன்ற விகுதிகளைப் பெறுவது பிறவினைகளே ஆகும் (தன்வினைகள் அல்ல; கூற்று 3 தவறு). எனவே 1 மற்றும் 2 சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Analyze the statements regarding Thanvinai (Direct Action) and Piravinai (Causative Action):\n1. When the subject directly performs the verbal action, it is Thanvinai (e.g., The ball rolled).\n2. When the subject causes another agent to perform the action, it is Piravinai (e.g., He rolled the ball).\n3. Thanvinai verbs strictly take causative suffixes like 'vi' and 'bi'.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 and 2 only are correct", "B": "2 and 3 only are correct", "C": "1 and 3 only are correct", "D": "All are correct"}, "explanation": "Causative suffixes like 'vi' and 'bi' form Piravinai (not Thanvinai). Statements 1 and 2 are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 18, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 18", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "thanvinai_piravinai", "statement_analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q130", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-05-eluthu-alapedai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-seivinai-seyappattuvinai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'திருவள்ளுவர் திருக்குறளை இயற்றினார்' — இத்தொடர் எவ்வகைத் தொடர்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "செயப்பாட்டுவினைத் தொடர்", "B": "செய்வினைத் தொடர்", "C": "பிறவினைத் தொடர்", "D": "எதிர்மறைத் தொடர்"}, "explanation": "எழுவாய் (திருவள்ளுவர்) செயப்படுபொருளோடு (திருக்குறளை - இரண்டாம் வேற்றுமை உருபு 'ஐ' ஏற்று) வினையைச் செய்வதால் இது 'செய்வினைத் தொடர்' ஆகும். ('திருக்குறள் திருவள்ளுவரால் இயற்றப்பட்டது' என்பது செயப்பாட்டுவினை)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'Thiruvalluvar composed the Thirukkural' (திருவள்ளுவர் திருக்குறளை இயற்றினார்) — What sentence type is this in Tamil syntax?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Passive Voice Sentence (Seyappattuvinai)", "B": "Active Voice Sentence (Seivinai)", "C": "Causative Sentence (Piravinai)", "D": "Negative Sentence (Ethirmarai)"}, "explanation": "The subject initiates the action directly with an accusative object ('Thirukkurallai'), forming an Active Voice (Seivinai) sentence."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu 