{"id": "9th-u1-q133", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-05-eluthu-alapedai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-alapedai-definitions-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "அளபெடைகளின் தன்மைகளையும் அவற்றுக்குரிய பெயர்களையும் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I:\na) ஓசை குறையும் போது அதனை நிறைவு செய்ய வரும் உயிரளபெடை\nb) ஓசை குறையாத இடத்திலும் இனிய ஓசைக்காக வரும் உயிரளபெடை\nc) பெயர்ச்சொல் வினையெச்சமாக மாற வரும் உயிரளபெடை\nd) மெய்யெழுத்துகளும் ஆய்தமும் நீண்டு ஒலிப்பது\n\nபட்டியல் II:\n1. செய்யுளிசை அளபெடை\n2. ஒற்றளபெடை\n3. சொல்லிசை அளபெடை\n4. இன்னிசை அளபெடை", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-4, c-3, d-2", "B": "a-4, b-1, c-3, d-2", "C": "a-1, b-3, c-4, d-2", "D": "a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3"}, "explanation": "ஓசை குறையும் போது நிறைவு செய்வது = செய்யுளிசை (1); இனிய ஓசைக்காக = இன்னிசை (4); பெயர்ச்சொல் வினையெச்சமாக = சொல்லிசை (3); மெய்/ஆய்தம் = ஒற்றளபெடை (2). வரிசை: 1, 4, 3, 2."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the operational definitions of Alapedai with their technical grammatical terms:\nList I: a) Vowel elongation to fulfill deficient meter, b) Vowel elongation purely for euphonic harmony, c) Vowel elongation transforming a noun into an adverbial participle, d) Metric elongation of consonants and Aytham\nList II: 1. Seyyulisai Alapedai, 2. Otralapedai, 3. Sollisai Alapedai, 4. Innisai Alapedai", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-4, c-3, d-2", "B": "a-4, b-1, c-3, d-2", "C": "a-1, b-3, c-4, d-2", "D": "a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3"}, "explanation": "Deficient meter = Seyyulisai (1); Euphonic sweetness = Innisai (4); Participle shift = Sollisai (3); Consonants = Otralapedai (2). Order: 1, 4, 3, 2."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 16, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 16", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "alapedai_definitions", "matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q134", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-05-eluthu-alapedai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-maathirai-calculation", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "மாத்திரை கணக்கீடு குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. தனி நெட்டெழுத்தின் மாத்திரை 2 ஆகும்.\n2. 'ஓஒதல்' என்பதில் 'ஓஒ' என்ற அளபெடை இணைந்த கூட்டெழுத்து மொத்தம் 3 மாத்திரைகளைப் பெறுகிறது.\n3. ஒற்றளபெடையில் அளபெடுத்த மெய்யெழுத்து தனித்து 2 மாத்திரைகளைப் பெறும்.\nமேற்கண்ட கூற்றுகளுள் தவறான கூற்று எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 மற்றும் 2", "B": "3 மட்டும்", "C": "2 மட்டும்", "D": "எதுவுமில்லை"}, "explanation": "ஒற்றளபெடையில் அளபெடுத்த மெய்யெழுத்து 1 மாத்திரையே பெறும் (அரை + அரை = 1 மாத்திரை; 2 மாத்திரை அல்ல; கூற்று 3 தவறு)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Examine the statements regarding Maathirai (metric unit) calculation:\n1. An isolated long vowel has a duration of 2 Maathirais.\n2. In 'Ooodhal', the elongated vocalic unit 'Oo-o' possesses a cumulative duration of 3 Maathirais.\n3. An elongated consonant in Otralapedai receives 2 full Maathirais.\nWhich statement is INCORRECT?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 and 2", "B": "3 only", "C": "2 only", "D": "None of the above"}, "explanation": "An elongated consonant in Otralapedai receives exactly 1 Maathirai (1/2 + 1/2 = 1), never 2. Statement 3 is false."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 16, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 16", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "maathirai_rules", "statement_analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q135", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-05-eluthu-alapedai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-seven-long-vowels", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "செய்யுளிசை அளபெடையில் அளபெடுக்கும் உயிரெழுத்துகள் எத்தனை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஐந்து குறில்கள்", "B": "பன்னிரண்டு உயிரெழுத்துகள்", "C": "ஏழு நெட்டெழுத்துகள் (ஆ, ஈ, ஊ, ஏ, ஐ, ஓ, ஔ)", "D": "பத்து சார்பெழுத்துகள்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 16: 'செய்யுளில் ஓசை குறையும் போது அதனை நிறைவு செய்ய மொழிக்கு முதலிலும் இடையிலும் இறுதியிலும் நிற்கிற உயிர் நெட்டெழுத்துகள் ஏழும் நீண்டு ஒலிக்கும்'."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "How many long vowels (Netteduthukkal) participate in Seyyulisai Alapedai?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Five short vowels", "B": "All twelve vowels", "C": "The seven long vowels (Aa, Ee, Oo, Ae, Ai, Oa, Au)", "D": "Ten dependent letters"}, "explanation": "All seven primary long vowels of the Tamil alphabet undergo Seyyulisai Alapedai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 16, "chapter": null, "section": null, "referen