{"id": "9th-u1-q158", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-06-iyal1-eval-pyq", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-pyq-tholkappiyam-features", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC முந்தைய வினா] தொல்காப்பியம் குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. தமிழில் நமக்குக் கிடைத்துள்ள மிகத் தொன்மையான முழுமையான இலக்கண நூல் தொல்காப்பியம் ஆகும்.\n2. தொல்காப்பியம் எழுத்து, சொல், பொருள் ஆகிய மூன்று அதிகாரங்களைக் கொண்டுள்ளது.\n3. இதன் காலம் கி.பி. 12-ஆம் நூற்றாண்டு எனப் பாடநூல் அட்டவணை குறிப்பிடுகிறது.\nமேற்கண்ட கூற்றுகளுள் சரியானவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அனைத்தும் சரி", "B": "1, 2 மட்டும் சரி", "C": "2, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "D": "1, 3 மட்டும் சரி"}, "explanation": "தொல்காப்பியத்தின் காலம் 'கி.மு. 3-ஆம் நூற்றாண்டு அளவில்' ஆகும் (கி.பி. 12 அல்ல; கூற்று 3 தவறு). எனவே 1 மற்றும் 2 சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] Analyze the statements concerning the classical grammar Tholkappiyam:\n1. Tholkappiyam is the earliest extant complete grammatical treatise in Tamil.\n2. It is divided into three major divisions: Ezhuthu (Orthography), Sol (Morphology/Syntax), and Porul (Poetics/Sociology).\n3. The textbook chronology dates it to the 12th century CE.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "All are correct", "B": "1 and 2 only are correct", "C": "2 and 3 only are correct", "D": "1 and 3 only are correct"}, "explanation": "Tholkappiyam dates to circa 3rd Century BCE (not 12th CE). Statements 1 and 2 are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 8, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 8", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": true, "exam": "TNPSC Group 2", "exam_name": null, "year": "2018", "paper": "General Tamil", "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["pyq", "tholkappiyam", "statement_analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q159", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-06-iyal1-eval-pyq", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-pyq-otralapedai-exam-id", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC குரூப் 4 முந்தைய வினா] பின்வரும் தொடர்களுள் 'ஒற்றளபெடை' பயின்றுவந்துள்ள சொல்லினைக் கண்டறிக:", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஓஒதல் வேண்டும்", "B": "கெடுப்பதூஉம்", "C": "எஃஃகிலங்கிய", "D": "உரனசைஇ"}, "explanation": "TNPSC அசல் தேர்வு வினா: 'எஃஃகிலங்கிய' என்பதில் ஆய்த ஒற்றெழுத்து அளபெடுத்து வந்துள்ளதால் இது ஒற்றளபெடை ஆகும். (ஓஒதல் = செய்யுளிசை; கெடுப்பதூஉம் = இன்னிசை; உரனசைஇ = சொல்லிசை)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC Group 4 PYQ] Identify the word demonstrating Otralapedai (Consonantal Elongation) among the options:", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Ooodhal Vendum", "B": "Keduppadhooum", "C": "Eh-h-kilangiya (எஃஃகிலங்கிய)", "D": "Uranasaii"}, "explanation": "Classic TNPSC question: 'Eh-h-kilangiya' exhibits Ayutha Otralapedai, while the others are vocalic elongations."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 16, "chapter": null,