{"id": "9th-u1-q161", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-06-iyal1-eval-pyq", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-bookback-agam-puram", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[புத்தக மதிப்பீடு] தமிழ் இலக்கியங்கள் எதனை அடிப்படையாகக் கொண்டு பாடப்பட்டன?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அகம் மற்றும் புறம்", "B": "கற்பனை கதைகள்", "C": "புராண நிகழ்வுகள் மட்டும்", "D": "மன்னர்களின் புகழ்ச்சி மட்டுமே"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 10 & 18: தமிழ் இலக்கியங்கள் தமிழர்களின் அக வாழ்வையும் புற வாழ்வையும் அடிப்படையாகக் கொண்டு அமைந்த வாழ்வியலின் கருவூலங்கள் ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[Textbook Evaluation] Upon what foundational thematic dualism is classical Tamil literature structured?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Agam (Inner emotional life) and Puram (Outer heroic civic life)", "B": "Pure fiction and mythology", "C": "Religious rituals only", "D": "Royal panegyrics alone"}, "explanation": "Agam (internal emotional love poetics) and Puram (external civic/heroic poetics) form the bedrock of Tamil literary classification."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 18, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 18", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["book_back", "agam_puram", "direct_mcq"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q162", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-06-iyal1-eval-pyq", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-bookback-voice-analysis", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[புத்தக மதிப்பீடு] செய்வினை, செயப்பாட்டுவினைத் தொடர்கள் குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. 'பாண்டியன் நெடுஞ்செழியனால் மதுரை ஆளப்பட்டது' என்பது செய்வினைத் தொடராகும்.\n2. செயப்படுபொருளோடு 'ஐ' உருபும், எழுவாயோடு வினைமுற்றும் இயைந்து வருவது செய்வினை எனப்படும்.\n3. செயப்பாட்டுவினையில் எழுவாய் மூன்றாம் வேற்றுமை 'ஆல்' உருபை ஏற்கும்.\nமேற்கண்ட கூற்றுகளுள் சரியானவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1, 2 மட்டும்", "B": "2, 3 மட்டும்", "C": "1, 3 மட்டும்", "D": "அனைத்தும்"}, "explanation": "'பாண்டியன் நெடுஞ்செழியனால் மதுரை ஆளப்பட்டது' என்பது செயப்பாட்டுவினை ஆகும் (செய்வினை அல்ல; கூற்று 1 தவறு). 2 மற்றும் 3 சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[Textbook Evaluation] Analyze the statements regarding voice in Tamil syntax:\n1. 'Madurai was ruled by Pandiyan Nedunchezhiyan' is an Active voice sentence.\n2. A sentence where the direct object takes accusative 'ai' and the subject acts is Active Voice (Seivinai).\n3. In Passive Voice (Seyappattuvinai), the agent typically takes the 3rd case instrumental suffix 'aal'.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 and 2 only", "B": "2 and 3 only", "C": "1 and 3 only", "D": "All 1, 2, and 3"}, "explanation": "The sentence in statement 1 is passive, not active. Statements 2 and 3 are grammatically correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 18, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 18", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["book_back", "voice", "statement_analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
